INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26264, '美官员努力推动增加加沙人道救援，英国向加沙运送两千吨食品', '<span class=\"dateline\">华盛顿 —&nbsp;</span> \n<p>在美国官员推动增加人道救援及下周在华盛顿与以色列官员就新的停火举行会谈的前夕，英国星期三（3月20日）宣布向加沙地带再运送一批食品救助。<br> <br> 英国外交部说，2000吨食品在约旦的帮助下进入加沙，正在由世界粮食计划署（World Food Program）的人员分发。<br> <br> 英国外交大臣卡梅隆在一份声明中说，“我们持续让救援流向加沙以结束那里的痛苦是非常关键的。这就是为什么由世界粮食计划署最新运抵的救助如此重要的原因。”<br> <br> 美国国务卿布林肯（Antony Blinken）定于这个星期在沙特和埃及举行会谈，聚焦在加沙实现一个新的停火、使被巴勒斯坦武装分子扣押的人质获释、强化向加沙运送救助的国际努力，以及战后在加沙解决管治、安全以及重新发展的问题。<br> <br> 随着战事仍在持续，美国官员多次表达对以色列进攻拉法计划的担忧。拉法位于加沙与埃及边境，那里有100多万巴勒斯坦人在躲避战争。</p>\n<div data-owner-ct=\"Article\" data-inline=\"False\"> \n <div class=\"media-block also-read\"> <a class=\"img-wrap img-wrap--size-3 also-read__img\" href=\"/a/un-warns-of-war-crime-in-gaza-20240319/7534526.html\" title=\"联合国人权事务负责人：以色列限制援助物资可能构成战争罪行\"> <span class=\"thumb thumb16_9\"> \n    <noscript class=\"nojs-img\"> \n     <img src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/35745460-b2e9-4231-bebc-066e6152b140_w100_r1.jpg\" alt=\"加沙地带贾巴里亚难民营的巴勒斯坦人正在等待领取免费食品。（2024年3月18日）\"> \n    </noscript> <img data-src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/35745460-b2e9-4231-bebc-066e6152b140_w100_r1.jpg\" alt=\"加沙地带贾巴里亚难民营的巴勒斯坦人正在等待领取免费食品。（2024年3月18日）\"> </span> </a> \n  <div class=\"media-block__content also-read__body also-read__body--h\"> <a href=\"/a/un-warns-of-war-crime-in-gaza-20240319/7534526.html\" title=\"联合国人权事务负责人：以色列限制援助物资可能构成战争罪行\"> <span class=\"also-read__text--label\"> 请同时参阅： </span> <h4 class=\"media-block__title media-block__title--size-3 also-read__text p-0\"> 联合国人权事务负责人：以色列限制援助物资可能构成战争罪行 </h4> </a> \n  </div> \n </div> \n</div> \n<p>联合国官员也表达了同样的忧虑。这个关切集中在拉法将出现人道主义灾难上，因为拉法是目前有限的救助能够进入加沙的主要入境点，而且也没有设立一个安全地区的明确计划，让巴勒斯坦人能够前往以躲避以色列的军事行动。<br> <br> 美国国防部周二晚间宣布，国防部长劳埃德·奥斯汀（Lloyd Austin）下周将在五角大楼与以色列国防部长约亚夫·加兰特（Yoav Gallant）举行会谈，讨论确保在拉法的巴勒斯坦人安全的计划。双方还将讨论的内容包括确保人质获释的努力以及让更多人道救助进入加沙的需求。<br> <br> 以色列总理本雅明·内塔尼亚胡（Benjamin Netanyahu）周二告诉以色列议员们说，他在与美国总统拜登的通话中明确表明，以色列“致力于完成在拉法剿灭那些哈马斯武装，只有从地面进入拉法，别无其他选择。”<br> <br> 同时，白宫高级官员也定于在华盛顿与以色列军方、情报及人道官员举行会晤。白宫新闻秘书卡琳·让-皮埃尔（Karine Jean-Pierre）说，这些会谈预计下周早些时候举行。<br> <br> 卡琳·让-皮埃尔周二对记者表示，美国一直在努力达成一个临时停火及人质获释的协议，而以色列需要在让人道救援“不受阻碍地进入”南北加沙上做得更多。<br> <br> 随着以色列展开清除加沙任何哈马斯控制的军事攻势，加沙大部分的基础设施和房屋被夷为平地。<br> <br> 布林肯周二援引联合国有关整个加沙人口都需要人道救助的报告，描述了他所称的加沙“糟糕的人道主义局势”。<br> <br> 同时，卡塔尔外交部发言人周二说，卡塔尔官员对以色列和哈马斯能够达成在加沙实现新的停火以及释放更多哈马斯扣押的人质表示“谨慎乐观”。<br> <br> 马吉德·安萨里（Majed al-Ansari）在多哈会谈后提供了有利的评估。这次会谈包括以色列情报首脑大卫·巴尼亚（David Barnea）。但安萨里表示，目前“宣布任何成功还为时过早”。<br> <br> 正在考虑中的新的六周休战，将是继11月为期一周的停火之后五个多月的战斗中的第二次。此外，新的冲突停火可能使得哈马斯扣押的剩余约100名人质中的约40人获释，以换取数十名被以色列监禁的巴勒斯坦人获释，以及以色列允许更多的粮食和人道主义援助进入加沙。<br> <br> 一名哈马斯官员说，拟议的协议要求以色列军队撤出“所有城市和人口稠密地区”。但官员们表示，细节问题尚未解决，谈判可能需要几天或几周的时间。谈判已经持续了数周，没有取得成果。<br> <br> 这场战争始于去年10月7日哈马斯发动的一次令人震惊的恐怖袭击，据以色列官员统计，该袭击造成1200人死亡，并导致约250名人质被俘。哈马斯控制的加沙卫生官员说，以色列在加沙的反攻已造成近32,000名巴勒斯坦人死亡，其中三分之二是妇女和儿童。以色列军方表示，已经打死数以千计的哈马斯武装分子。<br> <br> （本文参考了路透社、美联社和法新社的报道）</p>', NULL, 47415, 0, '2024-03-20 09:34:26', '2024-03-20 11:00:00', 1);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26265, '美股開盤在平盤狹幅震盪 投資人靜候Fed決策出爐', '<p>（中央社紐約2024年3月20日綜合外電報導）美國股市今天開盤在平盤上下狹幅震盪。投資人正等待美國聯邦準備理事會（Fed）的貨幣決策出爐。</p>\n<p>外界廣泛預期，聯準會將維持基準利率按兵不動，並為未來的貨幣政策軌跡提供線索。</p>\n<p>道瓊工業指數開盤小跌38.71點或0.1%，報39072.05點。</p>\n<p>標普500指數小漲3.18點或0.06%，開在5181.69點。</p>\n<p>那斯達克指數上揚18.97點或0.12%，開在16185.76點。</p>', NULL, 65717, 0, '2024-03-20 10:11:02', '2024-03-20 11:00:13', 3);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26266, '日圓走勢身不由己 兌美元創4個月新低 哈日族樂享「甜甜價」', '<p>日本央行（日銀）19日宣布結束長達17年的負利率政策。原本許多哈日族擔心日圓恐快速走升，紛紛趕在上周上車補貨日圓。但日圓卻持續走弱，今（20）日兌美元失守151，創4個月新低。</p>\n<p>據台銀牌告匯率，日圓現鈔賣出價今日中午掛出「0.2136」，拿10萬元新台幣可換到46萬8164日圓。對照近半年來匯率的相對高點0.2242，當時只能換到44萬6030日圓。兩者相差了2萬2134日圓。以深受台灣民眾喜愛的一蘭拉麵來看，相當於可以多吃22碗售價980日圓的豚骨拉麵。</p>\n<p>外媒指出，美國聯準會（Fed）本周召開的例會加劇了日圓的跌勢。交易員擔心Fed恐比預期更加強硬，紛紛轉向美元。分析師表示，Fed與美國利率仍是推動日圓的最大因素。</p>\n<p>不過想去日本旅遊的民眾，可別忘了抓緊換匯時機。有「日圓先生」之稱的日本前財務省官員榊原英資在接受美國財經媒體CNBC專訪時表示，如果日元兌美元匯率貶至155至160「有點太過頭」，到時日本當局可能會進行干預。他預估，今年底或明年初日圓恐回升至130的價位，「通膨時代即將來臨」。</p>\n<p><span>更多中時新聞網報導</span><br><a href=\"https://wantrich.chinatimes.com/news/20240313900624-420501?utm_source=yahoo_news&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:勞保年金太低？勞長喊所得替代率68％「對比軍公教」勞工集體崩潰了;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">勞保年金太低？勞長喊所得替代率68％「對比軍公教」勞工集體崩潰了</a><br><a href=\"https://wantrich.chinatimes.com/news/20240318900292-420401?utm_source=yahoo_news&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:00919跌就是買？八大官股掃貨10萬張 卻大賣中信金、元大金..6檔金融股;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">00919跌就是買？八大官股掃貨10萬張 卻大賣中信金、元大金..6檔金融股</a><br><a href=\"https://www.chinatimes.com/realtimenews/20240318000004-260410?utm_source=yahoo_news&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:台積電老大哥拉拔小弟！跳過設備廠 這4家供應鏈要出頭了;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">台積電老大哥拉拔小弟！跳過設備廠 這4家供應鏈要出頭了</a></p>', NULL, 45583, 0, '2024-03-20 09:24:51', '2024-03-20 11:00:14', 3);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26267, 'Powell podría dar pistas sobre si la Reserva Federal dejará de recortar tasas de interés', '<span class=\"dateline\">Washington —&nbsp;</span> \n<p>Hace dos semanas, el presidente Jerome Powell sugirió que la Reserva Federal “no estaba lejos” de tener la confianza necesaria de que la inflación se encaminaba de manera sostenible hacia su meta del 2 %, lo que le permitiría comenzar a recortar su tasa de interés de referencia.</p> \n<p>Fue una sugerencia alentadora, porque un recorte en la tasa clave de la Reserva Federal generalmente ha impulsado la economía al reducir el costo de los créditos, desde hipotecas hasta préstamos comerciales. También podría beneficiar la candidatura a la reelección del presidente Joe Biden, que enfrenta un descontento público generalizado por los niveles de precios en toda la economía.</p> \n<p>Sin embargo, desde entonces, las últimas cifras de inflación han resultado ser más altas de lo esperado: un informe del gobierno mostró que los precios al consumidor aumentaron de enero a febrero por encima de la meta de la Reserva Federal. Un segundo informe mostró que la inflación mayorista también fue sorprendentemente alta, una posible señal de que las presiones inflacionarias podrían seguir impulsando los precios en los próximos meses.</p>\n<div data-owner-ct=\"Article\" data-inline=\"False\"> \n <div class=\"media-block also-read\"> <a class=\"img-wrap img-wrap--size-3 also-read__img\" href=\"/a/powell-las-subidas-de-tasas-podrian-acelerarse-si-la-economia-se-mantiene-fuerte/6993982.html\" title=\"Powell: subidas de tasas podrían acelerarse si la economía se mantiene fuerte\"> <span class=\"thumb thumb16_9\"> \n    <noscript class=\"nojs-img\"> \n     <img src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-0d07-08db1f20ba79_cx0_cy6_cw0_w100_r1.jpg\" alt=\"El presidente de la Reserva Federal, Jerome Powell, habla en el Club Económico de Washington, el martes 7 de febrero de 2023, en el Renaissance Hotel en Washington. (Foto AP/Jess Rapfogel)\"> \n    </noscript> <img data-src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-0d07-08db1f20ba79_cx0_cy6_cw0_w100_r1.jpg\" alt=\"El presidente de la Reserva Federal, Jerome Powell, habla en el Club Económico de Washington, el martes 7 de febrero de 2023, en el Renaissance Hotel en Washington. (Foto AP/Jess Rapfogel)\"> </span> </a> \n  <div class=\"media-block__content also-read__body also-read__body--h\"> <a href=\"/a/powell-las-subidas-de-tasas-podrian-acelerarse-si-la-economia-se-mantiene-fuerte/6993982.html\" title=\"Powell: subidas de tasas podrían acelerarse si la economía se mantiene fuerte\"> <span class=\"also-read__text--label\"> También lea </span> <h4 class=\"media-block__title media-block__title--size-3 also-read__text p-0\"> Powell: subidas de tasas podrían acelerarse si la economía se mantiene fuerte </h4> </a> \n  </div> \n </div> \n</div> \n<p>Una pregunta clave para Powell y los otros 18 funcionarios del comité que fija las tasas de interés de la Reserva Federal es cómo –o si– esas cifras han alterado su cronograma para recortar las tasas. Seguramente Powell será consultado sobre el tema en su conferencia de prensa el miércoles, después de que la Reserva Federal finalice su última reunión de dos días. Las autoridades del banco central también publicarán sus proyecciones trimestrales actualizadas sobre cómo prevén que la economía y las tasas de interés cambiarán en los meses y años venideros.</p> \n<p>Sus proyecciones anteriores, emitidas en diciembre, mostraron que los funcionarios esperaban recortar su tasa de referencia tres veces este año, frente a un pronóstico anterior de dos recortes. La mayoría de los economistas creen que las últimas proyecciones trimestrales mostrarán nuevamente que las autoridades esperan recortar las tasas tres veces en 2024, aunque es posible que reduzcan la cifra esperada a dos. Los economistas en general prevén que el primer recorte de tipos se producirá en junio.</p> \n<p>El miércoles, se considera seguro que la Reserva Federal mantenga su tasa de corto plazo, ahora en un máximo de 23 años de casi 5,4 %, sin cambios por quinta vez consecutiva. Y puede que todavía no esté del todo claro para los funcionarios de la Reserva Federal si han mantenido las tasas lo suficientemente altas durante el tiempo suficiente para controlar completamente la inflación.</p> \n<p>La inflación al consumidor, medida año tras año, ha caído desde un máximo del 9,1 % en junio de 2022 al 3,2 %. Sin embargo, sigue estancado por encima del 3 %. Y en los primeros dos meses de 2024, los costos de servicios como alquileres, hoteles y hospitales se mantuvieron altos, lo que sugiere que las altas tasas de endeudamiento no están desacelerando lo suficiente la inflación en el vasto sector de servicios de la economía.</p> \n<p><em><strong>¡Conéctate con la Voz de América! Suscríbete a nuestros canales de <a class=\"wsw__a\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fredirect%3Fevent%3Dvideo_description%26redir_token%3DQUFFLUhqa0NnRmlwS0luajhoQjlQT05lLXNVWXdadTNCUXxBQ3Jtc0ttLW1XeUJ2X3dMc0dPQTFWdWtoNkFjNFdwd2tzQUJTY2FpcW9NMEtCUnZVSHpJVGM0UUxMZzJrY1YyclNBM1pqTEhDM0tfdFE0SVExZkxVUnhUZ2ExZFFYTHphdzJIb1ZsbXJ0N0UwTWhLQ0YyaENSQQ%26q%3Dhttp%253A%252F%252Fbit.ly%252F2XpJNZj&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cgocando%40associates.voanews.com%7C85e4290da0bc44559b1208db9a78d6f3%7Cba99e87c673541c2b1c1354eee3a8659%7C0%7C0%7C638273616021819023%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=kRr%2FwDwZSW6a2HxHlKx5fTtATO%2FHLLvji8ystpk3eL4%3D&amp;reserved=0\">YouTube</a>, <a class=\"wsw__a\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fchat.whatsapp.com%2FDXySZH8uwGCECxTdlELdDI&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cgocando%40associates.voanews.com%7C85e4290da0bc44559b1208db9a78d6f3%7Cba99e87c673541c2b1c1354eee3a8659%7C0%7C0%7C638273616021819023%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=0MBdqzsmJDCVgwQncezbUiCRCNCmmG51tGMAXbi%2BjOA%3D&amp;reserved=0\">WhatsApp</a> y al <a class=\"wsw__a\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.vozdeamerica.com%2FSubscribe.html&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cgocando%40associates.voanews.com%7C85e4290da0bc44559b1208db9a78d6f3%7Cba99e87c673541c2b1c1354eee3a8659%7C0%7C0%7C638273616021819023%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=Q9jqLLDg50OBNGlZK6ape%2BdbsolE4ufhSGg5osg3E90%3D&amp;reserved=0\">newsletter</a>. Activa las notificaciones y síguenos en <a class=\"wsw__a\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2FVozdeAmerica%2F&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cgocando%40associates.voanews.com%7C85e4290da0bc44559b1208db9a78d6f3%7Cba99e87c673541c2b1c1354eee3a8659%7C0%7C0%7C638273616021819023%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=vkGAj%2BhlF7OakeTgL2O6e%2B7hDX%2BXx8%2FlWr1%2BVOyw7oI%3D&amp;reserved=0\">Facebook</a>, <a class=\"wsw__a\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2FVozdeAmerica&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cgocando%40associates.voanews.com%7C85e4290da0bc44559b1208db9a78d6f3%7Cba99e87c673541c2b1c1354eee3a8659%7C0%7C0%7C638273616021819023%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=04xnVnq2F8KoAHEU5uUVoa6D0cygxmA%2FUeuEtKVON8U%3D&amp;reserved=0\">X</a> e <a class=\"wsw__a\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/vozdeamerica/\">Instagram</a>.</strong></em></p>', 'Las autoridades de la Reserva Federal de EEUU darán a conocer este miércoles sus proyecciones trimestrales actualizadas sobre el desempeño de la mayor economía mundial y su decisión sobre si habrá ajustes o no a la tasa referencial, anuncios que son ampliamente esperados por los mercados mundiales.', 37872, 0, '2024-03-20 10:08:30', '2024-03-20 11:00:23', 5);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26268, 'Is Now An Opportune Moment To Examine Trainline Plc (LON:TRN)?', '<p>Trainline Plc (<a href=\"https://au.finance.yahoo.com/quote/TRN.L\" data-ylk=\"slk:LON:TRN;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">LON:TRN</a>), is not the largest company out there, but it received a lot of attention from a substantial price increase on the LSE over the last few months. The company\'s trading levels have reached its high for the past year, following the recent bounce in the share price. With many analysts covering the mid-cap stock, we may expect any price-sensitive announcements have already been factored into the stock’s share price. However, could the stock still be trading at a relatively cheap price? Let’s take a look at Trainline’s outlook and value based on the most recent financial data to see if the opportunity still exists.</p>\n<p><span class=\"veryHighlightLink\"><a href=\"https://simplywall.st/company/id/A9763B0B-E80A-40BD-A61F-6D2A493F60CE?blueprint=2944814&amp;utm_medium=finance_user&amp;utm_campaign=cta&amp;utm_source=yahoo\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Check out our latest analysis for Trainline;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \"> Check out our latest analysis for Trainline </a></span></p>\n<h2>What Is Trainline Worth?</h2>\n<p>The stock is currently trading at UK£3.81 on the share market, which means it is overvalued by 34% compared to our intrinsic value of £2.83. Not the best news for investors looking to buy! If you like the stock, you may want to keep an eye out for a potential price decline in the future. Given that Trainline’s share is fairly volatile (i.e. its price movements are magnified relative to the rest of the market) this could mean the price can sink lower, giving us another chance to buy in the future. This is based on its high beta, which is a good indicator for share price volatility.</p>\n<h2>What does the future of Trainline look like?</h2>\n<figure class=\"caas-figure\">\n <div class=\"caas-figure-with-pb\" style=\"max-height: 524px\">\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"caas-img-container caas-img-loader\" style=\"padding-bottom:64%\">\n    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://simplywall.st/company/id/A9763B0B-E80A-40BD-A61F-6D2A493F60CE/future?blueprint=2944814&amp;utm_medium=finance_user&amp;utm_campaign=infographic&amp;utm_source=yahoo\" data-ylk><img class=\"caas-img caas-lazy\" alt=\"earnings-and-revenue-growth\" data-src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/FTH0sGig4nZBGwWhVDBk4g--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTYxMw--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/simply_wall_st__316/6c2b7ee63a2a2339b85186b964dd6ba4\">\n     <noscript>\n      <img alt=\"earnings-and-revenue-growth\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/FTH0sGig4nZBGwWhVDBk4g--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTYxMw--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/simply_wall_st__316/6c2b7ee63a2a2339b85186b964dd6ba4\" class=\"caas-img\">\n     </noscript></a>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"caption-wrapper caption-aligned-with-image\">\n  <figcaption class=\"caption-collapse\">\n   earnings-and-revenue-growth\n  </figcaption>\n </div>\n</figure>\n<p>Investors looking for growth in their portfolio may want to consider the prospects of a company before buying its shares. Although value investors would argue that it’s the intrinsic value relative to the price that matter the most, a more compelling investment thesis would be high growth potential at a cheap price. With profit expected to more than double over the next couple of years, the future seems bright for Trainline. It looks like higher cash flow is on the cards for the stock, which should feed into a higher share valuation.</p>\n<h2>What This Means For You</h2>\n<p><strong>Are you a shareholder?</strong> TRN’s optimistic future growth appears to have been factored into the current share price, with shares trading above its fair value. However, this brings up another question – is now the right time to sell? If you believe TRN should trade below its current price, selling high and buying it back up again when its price falls towards its real value can be profitable. But before you make this decision, take a look at whether its fundamentals have changed.</p>\n<div class=\"caas-da \">\n <div data-wf-benji-page-context=\"{&quot;pageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/now-opportune-moment-examine-trainline-144810594.html&quot;,&quot;spaceid&quot;:&quot;1187300073&quot;,&quot;site&quot;:&quot;finance&quot;,&quot;hashtag&quot;:&quot;investments;stocks;finance&quot;,&quot;lmsid&quot;:&quot;a0V0W00000HOZhrUAH&quot;,&quot;pct&quot;:&quot;story&quot;}\" data-wf-benji-wafer-config=\"{}\" data-wf-benji-config=\"{&quot;positions&quot;:{&quot;INARTICLE-dd243b24-9e2f-3da8-837a-24ebe7d0be4c1710946861369&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;INARTICLE-dd243b24-9e2f-3da8-837a-24ebe7d0be4c1710946861369&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/22888152279/${REGION}/yfin/ros/dt/${REGION}_yfin_ros_dt_mid_center&quot;,&quot;region&quot;:&quot;index&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;fluid&quot;,&quot;kvs&quot;:{&quot;loc&quot;:&quot;mid_center&quot;},&quot;disableRefresh&quot;:true}}}\" id=\"sda-INARTICLE-dd243b24-9e2f-3da8-837a-24ebe7d0be4c1710946861369\" class=\"wafer-benji caas-sda-benji-ad\" data-wf-trigger=\"onLoad\" data-wf-margin=\"100 0\">\n  <div id=\"sdaAdvText-INARTICLE-dd243b24-9e2f-3da8-837a-24ebe7d0be4c1710946861369\" class=\"caas-sda-adv-text\">\n   ADVERTISEMENT\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"INARTICLE-dd243b24-9e2f-3da8-837a-24ebe7d0be4c1710946861369\"></div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<p><strong>Are you a potential investor?</strong> If you’ve been keeping an eye on TRN for a while, now may not be the best time to enter into the stock. The price has surpassed its true value, which means there’s no upside from mispricing. However, the positive outlook is encouraging for TRN, which means it’s worth diving deeper into other factors in order to take advantage of the next price drop.</p>\n<p>Since timing is quite important when it comes to individual stock picking, it\'s worth taking a look at what those latest analysts forecasts are. So feel free to check out our free <a href=\"https://simplywall.st/company/id/A9763B0B-E80A-40BD-A61F-6D2A493F60CE/past?blueprint=2944814&amp;utm_medium=finance_user&amp;utm_campaign=conclusion&amp;utm_source=yahoo\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:graph representing analyst forecasts;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">graph representing analyst forecasts</a>.</p>\n<p>If you are no longer interested in Trainline, you can use our free platform to see our list of over <a href=\"https://simplywall.st/discover/investing-ideas/3401/large-cap-high-growth-potential?blueprint=2944814&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=finance_user&amp;utm_campaign=integrated-pitch\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:50 other stocks with a high growth potential.;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">50 other stocks with a high growth potential.</a></p>\n<p><strong>Have feedback on this article? Concerned about the content?</strong> <a href=\"https://feedback.simplywall.st/article/Mjk0NDgxNDoxYjBjZDljZWQ0N2ExNmQx\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Get in touch;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \"><strong>Get in touch</strong></a><strong> with us directly.</strong><i> Alternatively, email editorial-team (at) simplywallst.com.</i><br><br><i>This article by Simply Wall St is general in nature. <strong>We provide commentary based on historical data and analyst forecasts only using an unbiased methodology and our articles are not intended to be financial advice.</strong> It does not constitute a recommendation to buy or sell any stock, and does not take account of your objectives, or your financial situation. We aim to bring you long-term focused analysis driven by fundamental data. Note that our analysis may not factor in the latest price-sensitive company announcements or qualitative material. Simply Wall St has no position in any stocks mentioned.</i></p>', NULL, 20958, 0, '2024-03-20 10:48:10', '2024-03-20 11:01:02', 10);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26269, 'If You Invested $4,500 in 9 Companies With Jeff Bezos, You Would Be Worth $7,316', '<figure class=\"caas-figure\">\n <div class=\"caas-figure-with-pb\" style=\"max-height: 540px\">\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"caas-img-container\" style=\"padding-bottom:56%\">\n    <img class=\"caas-img has-preview\" alt=\"Chip Somodevilla / Getty Images\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/axaH8RR.T43_o_h5ZGwGAw--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTU0MA--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/gobankingrates_644/429968c1abfcd6e08204d14e916a22ae\" data-src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/axaH8RR.T43_o_h5ZGwGAw--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTU0MA--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/gobankingrates_644/429968c1abfcd6e08204d14e916a22ae\">\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"caption-wrapper caption-aligned-with-image\">\n  <figcaption class=\"caption-collapse\">\n   Chip Somodevilla / Getty Images\n  </figcaption>\n </div>\n</figure>\n<p>As of March 18, 2024, Jeff Bezos was the <a href=\"https://www.gobankingrates.com/category/investing/?utm_term=incontent_link_1&amp;utm_campaign=1265348&amp;utm_source=yahoo.com&amp;utm_content=1&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:third-richest person in the world;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">third-richest person in the world</a>, behind Bernard Arnault &amp; family and Elon Musk. Much of Bezos’ $194.2 billion net worth comes from Amazon, as he still holds close to 1 billion shares of the e-commerce giant that he founded.</p>\n<p>But, in addition to Amazon, Bezos holds a diversified portfolio that includes a number of publicly traded stocks. In other words, to some degree, even a small investor can “play along” and own some of the companies that make up part of Bezos’ billions. Important to note, however, is that many of these companies are speculative in nature, and the risk tolerance of a multi-billionaire is likely to be <a href=\"https://www.gobankingrates.com/investing/strategy/how-much-is-average-investor-saving-for-retirement-each-month/?utm_term=incontent_link_2&amp;utm_campaign=1265348&amp;utm_source=yahoo.com&amp;utm_content=2&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:much higher than the average investor;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">much higher than the average investor</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Check Out: <a href=\"https://www.gobankingrates.com/investing/stocks/self-made-millionaire-stocks-you-should-not-sell/?utm_term=related_link_1&amp;utm_campaign=1265348&amp;utm_source=yahoo.com&amp;utm_content=3&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:I’m a Self-Made Millionaire: 5 Stocks You Shouldn’t Sell;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">I’m a Self-Made Millionaire: 5 Stocks You Shouldn’t Sell</a><br>Read Next: <a href=\"https://www.gobankingrates.com/genius-wealthy-people-know-2058491/?utm_term=related_link_2&amp;utm_campaign=1265348&amp;utm_source=yahoo.com&amp;utm_content=4&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:6 Genius Things All Wealthy People Do With Their Money;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">6 Genius Things All Wealthy People Do With Their Money</a></strong></p>\n<p>Here’s a list of nine companies that Bezos is reported to own that you can also buy yourself, along with how much money you would have now if you invested in them when they initially went public. Note that while there’s no certainty as to the prices Bezos paid for these companies, it’s fair to assume he got in either at the time of their IPOs or perhaps even earlier.</p>\n<div class=\"caas-da \">\n <div data-wf-benji-page-context=\"{&quot;pageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/invested-4-500-9-companies-140019520.html&quot;,&quot;spaceid&quot;:&quot;1187300073&quot;,&quot;site&quot;:&quot;finance&quot;,&quot;hashtag&quot;:&quot;investments;ipos;stocks;finance;ipos&quot;,&quot;lmsid&quot;:&quot;a0V0W00000HOpMNUA1&quot;,&quot;pct&quot;:&quot;story&quot;}\" data-wf-benji-wafer-config=\"{}\" data-wf-benji-config=\"{&quot;positions&quot;:{&quot;INARTICLE-b225e41f-89a9-35e2-b59c-0cb5e320a0c51710946861801&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;INARTICLE-b225e41f-89a9-35e2-b59c-0cb5e320a0c51710946861801&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/22888152279/${REGION}/yfin/ros/dt/${REGION}_yfin_ros_dt_mid_center&quot;,&quot;region&quot;:&quot;index&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;fluid&quot;,&quot;kvs&quot;:{&quot;loc&quot;:&quot;mid_center&quot;},&quot;disableRefresh&quot;:true}}}\" id=\"sda-INARTICLE-b225e41f-89a9-35e2-b59c-0cb5e320a0c51710946861801\" class=\"wafer-benji caas-sda-benji-ad\" data-wf-trigger=\"onLoad\" data-wf-margin=\"100 0\">\n  <div id=\"sdaAdvText-INARTICLE-b225e41f-89a9-35e2-b59c-0cb5e320a0c51710946861801\" class=\"caas-sda-adv-text\">\n   ADVERTISEMENT\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"INARTICLE-b225e41f-89a9-35e2-b59c-0cb5e320a0c51710946861801\"></div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<p><strong>Sponsored: </strong><a href=\"https://products.gobankingrates.com/pub/e004dacc-4e5f-4895-a4e6-c5e1b145dd80?targeting%5Bcompany_product%5D=goldco-marketplace&amp;utm_source=yahoo.com&amp;utm_campaign=rss&amp;passthru=yahoo.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Protect Your Wealth With A Gold IRA. Take advantage of the timeless appeal of gold in a Gold IRA recommended by Sean Hannity.;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Protect Your Wealth With A Gold IRA. Take advantage of the timeless appeal of gold in a Gold IRA recommended by Sean Hannity.</a></p>\n<h2>Nautilus Biotechnology (NAUT)</h2>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p><strong>IPO price: </strong>$11.49* (via SPAC merger, or special purpose acquisition company, first traded publicly on 6/10/21)</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Price as of March 18, 2024: </strong>$2.60</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Today’s value of $500 invested at IPO price: </strong>$114.01</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Nautilus Biotechnology has had a rough go of it since it started trading publicly, losing investors 77% of their money.</p>\n<p><strong>Learn More: <a href=\"https://www.gobankingrates.com/investing/stocks/warren-buffett-sold-his-apple-stock-heres-why/?utm_term=related_link_3&amp;utm_campaign=1265348&amp;utm_source=yahoo.com&amp;utm_content=5&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Warren Buffett Sold His Apple Stock – Here’s Why;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Warren Buffett Sold His Apple Stock – Here’s Why</a></strong></p>\n<h2>Sonder Holdings (SOND)</h2>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p><strong>IPO price: </strong>$8.95 (via SPAC merger, 1/19/21)</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Price as of March 18, 2024: </strong>$3.40</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Today’s value of $500 invested at IPO price: </strong>$189.94</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Sonder Holdings hasn’t performed much better, dropping 62% as a public company. The tech-enabled hospitality company has turned $500 into just under $190.</p>\n<div class=\"caas-readmore caas-readmore-collapse\">\n <button class=\"link caas-button collapse-button\" data-ylk=\"elm:readmore;slk:Story continues\">Story continues</button>\n</div>\n<h2>Domo, Inc. (DOMO)</h2>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p><strong>IPO price: </strong>$21</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Price as of March 18, 2024: </strong>$9.33</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Value of $500 invested at IPO price: </strong>$222.14</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Domo’s cloud-based business intelligence platform is innovative but faces lots of competition, part of the reason its stock has dropped over 50% since its IPO.</p>\n<h2>Nextdoor Holdings, Inc. (KIND)</h2>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p><strong>IPO price: </strong>$11.12* (via SPAC offering on 11/8/21)</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Price as of March 18, 2024: </strong>$2.10</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Value of $500 invested at IPO price: </strong>$94.42</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>The community-based digital network is popular among users, but the company still posted a loss of nearly $148 million in 2023. Investors have pulled back from the stock, resulting in a loss of more than 80% as a public company.</p>\n<h2>Sana Biotechnology (SANA)</h2>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p><strong>IPO price: </strong>$25</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Price as of March 18, 2024: </strong>$9.73</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Value of $500 invested at IPO price: </strong>$194.60</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Like many biotech companies, Sana Biotechnology is still in its development phase, losing $317 million in 2023. While waiting for a big development, investors have lost 61% of their money.</p>\n<h2>Remitly Global (RELY)</h2>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p><strong>IPO price: </strong>$43</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Price as of March 18, 2024: </strong>$20.14</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Value of $500 invested at IPO price: </strong>$234.19</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Remitly Global is rapidly growing customers and revenue from the processing of global payments, but it’s still losing money, to the tune of $117.8 million in 2023. Unlike many other stocks on this list, however, analysts see continued growth ahead for the company, perhaps enough to recover the 53% loss that IPO investors have endured.</p>\n<h2>Denali Therapeutics (DNLI)</h2>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p><strong>IPO price: </strong>$18</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Price as of March 18, 2024: </strong>$20.09</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Value of $500 invested at IPO price: </strong>$558.06</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>After seven years as a publicly traded company, Denali Therapeutics has only eked out a small gain of just 11.6%. The stock did, however, offer a fantastic exit point when it peaked at $93.56 on Dec. 22, 2020.</p>\n<h2>Workday, Inc. (WDAY)</h2>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p><strong>IPO price: </strong>$28</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Price as of March 18, 2024: </strong>$272.60</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Value of $500 invested at IPO price: </strong>$4,867.86</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Workday has by far been the best performer in the public Bezos portfolio, but it’s also been around for 12 years. Still, investors are no doubt ecstatic at the “9-bagger” stock that has returned 873%.</p>\n<h2>Uber Technologies (UBER)</h2>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p><strong>IPO price: </strong>$45</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Price as of March 18, 2024: </strong>$75.70</p></li>\n <li><p><strong>Value of $500 invested at IPO price: </strong>$841.11</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>When Uber went public in 2019, it was one of the biggest initial public offerings in history, raising $8.1 billion for the company. In the nearly five years since its IPO, Uber has provided investors with a return of 68%.</p>\n<h2>Total Return</h2>\n<p>If you had invested $500 into each of these companies at their IPO prices — for a total of $4,500 — your portfolio value as of March 18, 2024, would be $7,316.33. That amounts to a net gain of 62.6%. If nothing else, it shows that one big winner can be good enough to offset losses in a number of other securities. Without Workday, the nine-stock portfolio would be at a net loss.</p>\n<h2>The Bottom Line</h2>\n<p>If you’re really looking to invest like Bezos, it might be best just to stick with Amazon, as many of the companies on this list are aggressive and/or speculative. In short, while you may invest in any of these companies based on your own research, buying them just because Bezos owns them isn’t generally a sound investment strategy.</p>\n<p><strong>More From GOBankingRates</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p><a href=\"https://www.gobankingrates.com/retirement/planning/downsizing-for-retirement-avoid-these-mistakes/?utm_term=incontent_link_3&amp;utm_campaign=1265348&amp;utm_source=yahoo.com&amp;utm_content=6&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Downsizing for Retirement? Avoid These 6 Mistakes;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \"><strong>Downsizing for Retirement? Avoid These 6 Mistakes</strong></a></p></li>\n <li><p><a href=\"https://www.gobankingrates.com/money/wealth/rare-coins-that-sold-for-at-least-600000/?utm_term=incontent_link_4&amp;utm_campaign=1265348&amp;utm_source=yahoo.com&amp;utm_content=7&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:5 Rare Coins That Sold for At Least $600,000;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \"><strong>5 Rare Coins That Sold for At Least $600,000</strong></a></p></li>\n <li><p><a href=\"https://www.gobankingrates.com/banking/interest-rates/what-bank-high-apy-on-savings/?utm_term=incontent_link_5&amp;utm_campaign=1265348&amp;utm_source=yahoo.com&amp;utm_content=8&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:One Simple Way to Earn More on Your Savings in 2024;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \"><strong>One Simple Way to Earn More on Your Savings in 2024</strong></a></p></li>\n <li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.gobankingrates.com/taxes/refunds/biggest-mistake-tax-refund-avoid-it/?utm_term=incontent_link_6&amp;utm_campaign=1265348&amp;utm_source=yahoo.com&amp;utm_content=9&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:The Biggest Mistake People Make With Their Tax Refund -- And How to Avoid It;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">The Biggest Mistake People Make With Their Tax Refund -- And How to Avoid It</a></strong></p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>This article originally appeared on <a href=\"https://www.gobankingrates.com?utm_term=incontent_link_7&amp;utm_campaign=1265348&amp;utm_source=yahoo.com&amp;utm_content=10&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:GOBankingRates.com;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">GOBankingRates.com</a>: <a href=\"https://www.gobankingrates.com/investing/stocks/if-you-invested-in-these-companies-with-jeff-bezos-you-would-be-worth/?utm_term=incontent_link_8&amp;utm_campaign=1265348&amp;utm_source=yahoo.com&amp;utm_content=11&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:If You Invested $4,500 in 9 Companies With Jeff Bezos, You Would Be Worth $7,316;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">If You Invested $4,500 in 9 Companies With Jeff Bezos, You Would Be Worth $7,316</a></p>', NULL, 34536, 0, '2024-03-20 10:00:19', '2024-03-20 11:01:02', 10);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26270, 'Moçambique: FDS recuperam Quirimba e Quissanga do controlo de insurgentes', '<span class=\"dateline\">Maputo —&nbsp;</span> \n<p>O governador provincial de Cabo Delgado diz que as Forças de Defesa e Segurança (FDS) já reassumiram o controlo da ilha Quirimba, no distrito do Ibo, e da vila-sede de Quissanga que haviam sido tomadas pelos insurgentes, durante a nova vaga de ataques àquela província no início de março.</p> \n<p>Entretanto, a organização não governamental Save The Children alerta que ataques surpresas estão a deixar as pessoas numa situação de extrema vulnerabilidade.</p> \n<p>O Governo nunca assumiu, publicamente, que a ilha Quirimbas e<br> a vila de Quissanga tinham sido tomadas pelos insurgentes, na sequência dos sucessivos ataques àquelas regiões, que provocram uma nova vaga de deslocados.</p>\n<div data-owner-ct=\"Article\" data-inline=\"False\"> \n <div class=\"media-block also-read\"> <a class=\"img-wrap img-wrap--size-3 also-read__img\" href=\"/a/mo%C3%A7ambique-residentes-da-ilha-quirimba-controlada-por-insurgentes-com-escassez-de-alimentos/7527862.html\" title=\"Moçambique: Residentes da ilha Quirimba controlada por insurgentes com escassez de alimentos\"> <span class=\"thumb thumb16_9\"> \n    <noscript class=\"nojs-img\"> \n     <img src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-b9b2-08dc44599919_cx0_cy17_cw0_w100_r1.jpeg\" alt=\"Quirimbas, Moçambique\"> \n    </noscript> <img data-src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-b9b2-08dc44599919_cx0_cy17_cw0_w100_r1.jpeg\" alt=\"Quirimbas, Moçambique\"> </span> </a> \n  <div class=\"media-block__content also-read__body also-read__body--h\"> <a href=\"/a/mo%C3%A7ambique-residentes-da-ilha-quirimba-controlada-por-insurgentes-com-escassez-de-alimentos/7527862.html\" title=\"Moçambique: Residentes da ilha Quirimba controlada por insurgentes com escassez de alimentos\"> <span class=\"also-read__text--label\"> Veja Também </span> <h4 class=\"media-block__title media-block__title--size-3 also-read__text p-0\"> Moçambique: Residentes da ilha Quirimba controlada por insurgentes com escassez de alimentos </h4> </a> \n  </div> \n </div> \n</div> \n<p>Agora, o governador de Cabo Delgado disse que a reposição da ordem e tranquilidade públicas resultou da implementação, pelas FDS, de uma estratégia de combate desde Chiure, passando por Ancuabe até ao distrito de Quissanga. </p> \n<p>Valigy Tauabo referiu que já está em curso o fornecimento de bens alimentares e outros produtos essenciais, que \"tinham sido saqueados pelos terroristas\".</p>\n<div data-owner-ct=\"Article\" data-inline=\"False\"> \n <div class=\"media-block also-read\"> <a class=\"img-wrap img-wrap--size-3 also-read__img\" href=\"/a/cabo-delgado-insurgentes-ocupam-ilha-de-quirimba-e-popula%C3%A7%C3%A3o-foge-para-pemba/7512893.html\" title=\"Cabo Delgado: Insurgentes ocupam ilha de Quirimba e população foge para Pemba\"> <span class=\"thumb thumb16_9\"> \n    <noscript class=\"nojs-img\"> \n     <img src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/DEB24B61-BE8E-4ABB-8071-6231B8C65C02_w100_r1.jpg\" alt=\"Deslocados de guerra chegam a Pemba, Cabo Delgado, Moçambique (Foto de Arquivo)\"> \n    </noscript> <img data-src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/DEB24B61-BE8E-4ABB-8071-6231B8C65C02_w100_r1.jpg\" alt=\"Deslocados de guerra chegam a Pemba, Cabo Delgado, Moçambique (Foto de Arquivo)\"> </span> </a> \n  <div class=\"media-block__content also-read__body also-read__body--h\"> <a href=\"/a/cabo-delgado-insurgentes-ocupam-ilha-de-quirimba-e-popula%C3%A7%C3%A3o-foge-para-pemba/7512893.html\" title=\"Cabo Delgado: Insurgentes ocupam ilha de Quirimba e população foge para Pemba\"> <span class=\"also-read__text--label\"> Veja Também </span> <h4 class=\"media-block__title media-block__title--size-3 also-read__text p-0\"> Cabo Delgado: Insurgentes ocupam ilha de Quirimba e população foge para Pemba </h4> </a> \n  </div> \n </div> \n</div> \n<p>Entretanto, Rui Muthemba, da organização não-governamental Save The Children, manifestou a sua extrema preocupação, particularmente com os ataques surpresas, que deixam as populações numa situação de<br> vulnerabilidade. </p> \n<p>\"As famílias são obrigadas a abandonar as suas casas, as suas aldeias sem que haja tempo para levar qualquer bem, incluindo a própria documentação das crianças’’, realçou Muthemba.</p>\n<div data-owner-ct=\"Article\" data-inline=\"False\"> \n <div class=\"media-block also-read\"> <a class=\"img-wrap img-wrap--size-3 also-read__img\" href=\"/a/cabo-delgado-insurgentes-voltam-a-criar-p%C3%A2nico-em-quissanga/7511681.html\" title=\"Cabo Delgado: Insurgentes voltam a criar pânico em Quissanga\"> <span class=\"thumb thumb16_9\"> \n    <noscript class=\"nojs-img\"> \n     <img src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/02870000-0aff-0242-cb07-08da119973a0_w100_r1.jpg\" alt=\"Hospital de Quissanga hospital destruído pelos inusrgentes em abril de 2020, Cabo Delgado, Moçambique\"> \n    </noscript> <img data-src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/02870000-0aff-0242-cb07-08da119973a0_w100_r1.jpg\" alt=\"Hospital de Quissanga hospital destruído pelos inusrgentes em abril de 2020, Cabo Delgado, Moçambique\"> </span> </a> \n  <div class=\"media-block__content also-read__body also-read__body--h\"> <a href=\"/a/cabo-delgado-insurgentes-voltam-a-criar-p%C3%A2nico-em-quissanga/7511681.html\" title=\"Cabo Delgado: Insurgentes voltam a criar pânico em Quissanga\"> <span class=\"also-read__text--label\"> Veja Também </span> <h4 class=\"media-block__title media-block__title--size-3 also-read__text p-0\"> Cabo Delgado: Insurgentes voltam a criar pânico em Quissanga </h4> </a> \n  </div> \n </div> \n</div> \n<p>A nova onda de ataques registada no início do mês nos distritos de Macomia, Chiure e Mecufe obrigou cerca de 100 mil pessoas a deixarem as suas casas, de acordo com uma estimaiva da Organização Internacional das Migrações.</p>', 'Organização não governamental Save The Children alerta que ataques surpresas estão a deixar as pessoas numa situação de extrema vulnerabilidade.', 93710, 0, '2024-03-20 10:43:23', '2024-03-20 11:01:21', 13);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26271, '台灣東洋三箭齊發 進軍國際市場', '<figure class=\"caas-figure\">\n <div class=\"caas-figure-with-pb\" style=\"max-height: 1280px\">\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"caas-img-container portrait\" style=\"padding-bottom:133%\">\n    <img class=\"caas-img has-preview\" alt=\"台灣東洋總經理侯靜蘭20日表示，營運三箭齊發，力拼雙位數成長，帶領台灣東洋進軍國際市場。(洪凱音攝影╱洪凱音台北傳真)\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/SsZeuECTxCNxb6nAVSGOYA--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTEyODA-/https://media.zenfs.com/ko/chinatimes_money_465/fde15430b7d1028b259c4441bb9c851f\" data-src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/SsZeuECTxCNxb6nAVSGOYA--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTEyODA-/https://media.zenfs.com/ko/chinatimes_money_465/fde15430b7d1028b259c4441bb9c851f\">\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"caption-wrapper caption-aligned-with-image\">\n  <figcaption class=\"caption-collapse\">\n   台灣東洋總經理侯靜蘭20日表示，營運三箭齊發，力拼雙位數成長，帶領台灣東洋進軍國際市場。(洪凱音攝影╱洪凱音台北傳真)\n  </figcaption>\n </div>\n</figure>\n<p>台灣東洋總經理侯靜蘭20日表示，今年發展重心將以授權引入國際新藥、外銷困難學名藥以及自製國產新藥等「三箭齊發」，在去年建構營運「雙引擎」的推升下，力拼雙位數成長，帶領台灣東洋進軍國際市場。</p>\n<p>侯靜蘭自2022年4月18日上任後，藉由自己多年外商藥廠的豐富經驗，導入國際化管理思維、多樣性工作文化的觀念，在企業永續經營、海內外市場開拓、前沿產品布局、生產量能優化、國際人才培育等面向，都有長足的進步。</p>\n<p>侯靜蘭表示，公司積極延攬國際人才、透過輪調來做更周全的人才培育，她很感謝台灣東洋的支持相挺；侯靜蘭認為，台灣東洋能扮演好台灣癌症領域第一品牌、急重症藥物大廠的角色，立足台灣，放眼全球。</p>\n<p>海外布局方面，台灣東洋最為生技產業熟知的微脂體技術持續扮演成長引擎，自製治療全身侵入性黴菌的微脂體兩性黴素學名藥Amphotericin B（Lipo-AB）先後取得台灣、美國藥證，不僅持續在美上市帶來穩定收益，也藉由美國市場，將台灣東洋的國產困難學名藥擴展歐、美市場。</p>\n<p>除歐、美國市場外，侯靜蘭表示，去年啟動「東協醫藥合作計畫」將資源聚焦在有發展潛力的越南，未來三年持續上市更多癌症藥品、擴展抗感染領域市場。</p>\n<p>隨全球藥品支出持續成長，加上精準醫療快速發展、AI智慧醫療導入，癌症治療相關領域的發展，將會持續展現爆發力；侯靜蘭表示，台灣東洋掌握自身在癌症領域深耕的利基，近年來不斷引進新興藥物、投入臨床試驗、新增適應症，並採取與國際大廠結盟的合作方式，持續擴充癌症相關藥物的產品組合，今年成績大有斬獲。</p>\n<div class=\"caas-da \">\n <div data-wf-benji-page-context=\"{&quot;pageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://tw.stock.yahoo.com/news/%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3%E6%9D%B1%E6%B4%8B%E4%B8%89%E7%AE%AD%E9%BD%8A%E7%99%BC-%E9%80%B2%E8%BB%8D%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4-141815787.html&quot;,&quot;spaceid&quot;:&quot;794031262&quot;,&quot;site&quot;:&quot;finance&quot;,&quot;hashtag&quot;:&quot;finance&quot;,&quot;lmsid&quot;:&quot;a0V6T00000KBhjYUAT&quot;,&quot;pct&quot;:&quot;story&quot;}\" data-wf-benji-wafer-config=\"{}\" data-wf-benji-config=\"{&quot;positions&quot;:{&quot;INARTICLE-9515bf67-cdca-3140-a255-b6dc4e8812291710950413891&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;INARTICLE-9515bf67-cdca-3140-a255-b6dc4e8812291710950413891&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/22888152279/${REGION}/yfin/ros/dt/${REGION}_yfin_ros_dt_mid_center&quot;,&quot;region&quot;:&quot;index&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;fluid&quot;,&quot;kvs&quot;:{&quot;loc&quot;:&quot;mid_center&quot;},&quot;disableRefresh&quot;:true}}}\" id=\"sda-INARTICLE-9515bf67-cdca-3140-a255-b6dc4e8812291710950413891\" class=\"wafer-benji caas-sda-benji-ad\" data-wf-trigger=\"onLoad\" data-wf-margin=\"100 0\">\n  <div id=\"sdaAdvText-INARTICLE-9515bf67-cdca-3140-a255-b6dc4e8812291710950413891\" class=\"caas-sda-adv-text\">\n   廣告\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"INARTICLE-9515bf67-cdca-3140-a255-b6dc4e8812291710950413891\"></div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<p>在「授權引入國際新藥」方面，除了癌症相關領域的發展之外，台灣東洋已經連續5年代理歐美流感疫苗大廠CSL Seqirus的細胞流感疫苗，今年將會繼續參與公費招標；侯靜蘭進一步表示，這不僅是要將國際最新的流感疫苗引進國內，也針對國內高齡化社會需求，引進65歲成人適用的自費佐劑流感疫苗，希望為不同年齡族群提供最適切的疫苗選擇，近一年來國人自費打流感疫苗意願也提升。</p>\n<p>台灣東洋也持續投注資源，成功開發國產抗生素新藥Polymyxin B，以堅定的行動回應醫療臨床上的需求，以及協助解決國家面臨潛在的抗生素國安危機，而六堵廠為符合國際標準、也通過查廠檢驗的完整產線，在「自製國產新藥」方面，交出亮麗的成績。</p>\n<p><span>更多中時新聞網報導</span><br><a href=\"https://www.chinatimes.com/realtimenews/20240314003331-260410?utm_source=yahoo_news&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:關鍵是台積電！專家驚曝南科稱霸時代來了：房市掀巨變;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">關鍵是台積電！專家驚曝南科稱霸時代來了：房市掀巨變</a><br><span>美國廠危險！進度落後還大缺工 台積電急了祭出1招搶救</span><br><a href=\"https://www.chinatimes.com/realtimenews/20240316001617-260410?utm_source=yahoo_news&amp;utm_medium=rss\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:台積電下周除息 黃仁勳出手救？輝達AI盛宴 點名17檔大贏家;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">台積電下周除息 黃仁勳出手救？輝達AI盛宴 點名17檔大贏家</a></p>', NULL, 44585, 0, '2024-03-20 10:18:15', '2024-03-20 12:00:14', 3);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26272, 'Au Zimbabwe, El Nino fait ressurgir le spectre de la faim', '<p><em>\"Nous devrions compter sur du maïs fraichement récolté, des citrouilles et des arachides. Mais cette année rien ne pousse dans les champs\"</em>, se désole l\'agricultrice de 38 ans rencontrée dans le village de Kanyemba, dans le nord-est du pays.</p>\n<div class=\"wsw__embed\"> \n <div class=\"media-pholder media-pholder--video \"> \n  <div class=\"c-sticky-container\" data-poster=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-bd4a-08dc483e7c80_tv_w250_r1.jpg\"> \n   <div class=\"c-sticky-element\" data-sp_api=\"pangea-video\" data-persistent data-persistent-browse-out> \n    <div class=\"c-mmp c-mmp--enabled c-mmp--loading c-mmp--video c-mmp--standard c-mmp--has-poster c-sticky-element__swipe-el\" data-player_id=\"\" data-title=\"Tabac : L\'avenir incertain d\'une culture controversée au Zimbabwe\" data-hide-title=\"False\" data-breakpoint_s=\"320\" data-breakpoint_m=\"640\" data-breakpoint_l=\"992\" data-hlsjs-src=\"/Scripts/responsive/hls.b\" data-bypass-dash-for-vod=\"true\" data-bypass-dash-for-live-video=\"true\" data-bypass-dash-for-live-audio=\"true\"> \n     <div class=\"c-mmp__poster js-poster c-mmp__poster--video\"> \n      <img src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-bd4a-08dc483e7c80_tv_w250_r1.jpg\" alt=\"Tabac : L\'avenir incertain d\'une culture controversée au Zimbabwe\" title=\"Tabac : L\'avenir incertain d\'une culture controversée au Zimbabwe\"> \n     </div> <a class=\"c-mmp__fallback-link\" href=\"https://av.voanews.com/Videoroot/Pangeavideo/2024/03/0/01/01000000-0aff-0242-bd4a-08dc483e7c80_240p.mp4\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__fallback-link-icon\"> <span class=\"ico ico-play\"></span> </span> </a> \n     <div class=\"c-spinner\"> \n      <img src=\"/Content/responsive/img/player-spinner.png\" alt=\"Attendez s\'il vous plaît \" title=\"Attendez s\'il vous plaît \"> \n     </div> <span class=\"c-mmp__big_play_btn js-btn-play-big\"> <span cl