INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26433, 'Third Avenue Value Fund Adjusts Portfolio, Warrior Met Coal Sees Significant Reduction', '<h2>Insights from the First Quarter of 2024 N-PORT Filing</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/StockBuy.php?GuruName=Third+Avenue+Value+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Third Avenue Value Fund;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Third Avenue Value Fund</a> (<a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/StockBuy.php?GuruName=Third+Avenue+Value+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Trades;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Trades</a>, <a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/holdings.php?GuruName=Third+Avenue+Value+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Portfolio;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Portfolio</a>), established by the renowned Martin J. Whitman in 1990, has recently disclosed its investment activities for the first quarter of 2024. The fund is known for its global, all-cap equities approach and its penchant for investing in credit securities. With a keen eye for financial strength and the potential for NAV compounding, <a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/StockBuy.php?GuruName=Third+Avenue+Value+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Third Avenue Value Fund;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Third Avenue Value Fund</a> (<a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/StockBuy.php?GuruName=Third+Avenue+Value+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Trades;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Trades</a>, <a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/holdings.php?GuruName=Third+Avenue+Value+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Portfolio;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Portfolio</a>) seeks out investments that are significantly undervalued relative to their intrinsic business value. The fund\'s latest N-PORT filing reveals strategic moves that reflect its commitment to long-term capital appreciation through a portfolio of contrarian and special-situation opportunities.</p>\n<figure class=\"caas-figure\">\n <div class=\"caas-figure-with-pb\" style=\"max-height: 697px\">\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"caas-img-container caas-img-loader\" style=\"padding-bottom:73%\">\n    <img class=\"caas-img caas-lazy has-preview\" alt=\"Third Avenue Value Fund Adjusts Portfolio, Warrior Met Coal Sees Significant Reduction\" data-src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/ZmejU0UIP67vdOgKsfNXNQ--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTY5Nw--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/us.finance.gurufocus/7e41473fb07702f85910b3d0901baf4c\">\n    <noscript>\n     <img alt=\"Third Avenue Value Fund Adjusts Portfolio, Warrior Met Coal Sees Significant Reduction\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/ZmejU0UIP67vdOgKsfNXNQ--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTY5Nw--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/us.finance.gurufocus/7e41473fb07702f85910b3d0901baf4c\" class=\"caas-img\">\n    </noscript>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"caption-wrapper caption-aligned-with-image\">\n  <figcaption class=\"caption-collapse\">\n   Third Avenue Value Fund Adjusts Portfolio, Warrior Met Coal Sees Significant Reduction\n  </figcaption>\n </div>\n</figure>\n<h3>New Additions to the Portfolio</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/StockBuy.php?GuruName=Third+Avenue+Value+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Third Avenue Value Fund;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Third Avenue Value Fund</a> (<a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/StockBuy.php?GuruName=Third+Avenue+Value+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Trades;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Trades</a>, <a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/holdings.php?GuruName=Third+Avenue+Value+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Portfolio;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Portfolio</a>) has expanded its portfolio with a new acquisition:</p>\n<div class=\"caas-da \">\n <div data-wf-benji-page-context=\"{&quot;pageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/third-avenue-value-fund-adjusts-230254928.html&quot;,&quot;spaceid&quot;:&quot;1187300073&quot;,&quot;site&quot;:&quot;finance&quot;,&quot;hashtag&quot;:&quot;investments;stocks;finance;mutualfunds&quot;,&quot;lmsid&quot;:&quot;a0Vd0000003tnQZEAY&quot;,&quot;pct&quot;:&quot;story&quot;}\" data-wf-benji-wafer-config=\"{}\" data-wf-benji-config=\"{&quot;positions&quot;:{&quot;INARTICLE-b599109a-a291-378c-9de2-a2231f5cdeaa1711065667076&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;INARTICLE-b599109a-a291-378c-9de2-a2231f5cdeaa1711065667076&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/22888152279/${REGION}/yfin/ros/dt/${REGION}_yfin_ros_dt_mid_center&quot;,&quot;region&quot;:&quot;index&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;fluid&quot;,&quot;kvs&quot;:{&quot;loc&quot;:&quot;mid_center&quot;},&quot;disableRefresh&quot;:true}}}\" id=\"sda-INARTICLE-b599109a-a291-378c-9de2-a2231f5cdeaa1711065667076\" class=\"wafer-benji caas-sda-benji-ad\" data-wf-trigger=\"onLoad\" data-wf-margin=\"100 0\">\n  <div id=\"sdaAdvText-INARTICLE-b599109a-a291-378c-9de2-a2231f5cdeaa1711065667076\" class=\"caas-sda-adv-text\">\n   ADVERTISEMENT\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"INARTICLE-b599109a-a291-378c-9de2-a2231f5cdeaa1711065667076\"></div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p>The fund\'s most significant new holding is Bolsa Mexicana de Valores SAB de CV (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/MEX:BOLSAA/GF-Score/Warrior+Met+Coal+Inc\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:MEX:BOLSAA;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">MEX:BOLSAA</a>), purchasing 4,227,162 shares. This position represents 1.39% of the portfolio, with a total value of MXN 85.91 million.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Key Position Increases</h3>\n<p>The fund has also bolstered its stakes in several companies:</p>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p>CK Hutchison Holdings Ltd (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/HKSE:00001/GF-Score/Warrior+Met+Coal+Inc\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:HKSE:00001;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">HKSE:00001</a>) saw an additional 2,497,000 shares added, bringing the total to 3,560,480 shares. This represents a substantial 234.8% increase in share count and a 2.08% impact on the current portfolio, valued at HK$183.89 million.</p></li>\n <li><p>S4 Capital PLC (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/LSE:SFOR/GF-Score/Warrior+Met+Coal+Inc\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:LSE:SFOR;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">LSE:SFOR</a>) also experienced a significant boost with 7,558,242 additional shares, resulting in a total holding of 31,680,582 shares. This adjustment marks a 31.33% increase in share count, with a total value of 17.66 million.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Complete Exits from Holdings</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/StockBuy.php?GuruName=Third+Avenue+Value+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Third Avenue Value Fund;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Third Avenue Value Fund</a> (<a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/StockBuy.php?GuruName=Third+Avenue+Value+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Trades;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Trades</a>, <a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/holdings.php?GuruName=Third+Avenue+Value+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Portfolio;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Portfolio</a>) has fully divested from two positions in the first quarter of 2024:</p>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p>The fund sold all 989,199 shares of Ashmore Group PLC (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/LSE:ASHM/GF-Score/Warrior+Met+Coal+Inc\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:LSE:ASHM;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">LSE:ASHM</a>), impacting the portfolio by -0.38%.</p></li>\n <li><p>All 1,484,127 shares of Hutchison Port Holdings Trust (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/HCTPF/GF-Score/Warrior+Met+Coal+Inc\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:HCTPF;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">HCTPF</a>) were liquidated, causing a -0.04% impact on the portfolio.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"caas-readmore caas-readmore-collapse\">\n <button class=\"link caas-button collapse-button\" data-ylk=\"elm:readmore;slk:Story continues\">Story continues</button>\n</div>\n<h3>Significant Reductions in Holdings</h3>\n<p>Reductions were made in four stocks, with notable changes including:</p>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p>Warrior Met Coal Inc (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/HCC/GF-Score/Warrior+Met+Coal+Inc\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:NYSE:HCC;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">NYSE:HCC</a>) saw a reduction of 446,495 shares, a -40.16% decrease, affecting the portfolio by -4.08%. The stock\'s average trading price was $58.27 during the quarter, with a -7.09% return over the past three months and -6.42% year-to-date.</p></li>\n <li><p>Tidewater Inc (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TDW/GF-Score/Warrior+Met+Coal+Inc\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:NYSE:TDW;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">NYSE:TDW</a>) was reduced by 106,287 shares, a -19.21% decrease, impacting the portfolio by -1.36%. The stock traded at an average price of $64.87 during the quarter, returning 26.02% over the past three months and 24.60% year-to-date.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Portfolio Overview and Sector Allocation</h3>\n<p>As of the first quarter of 2024, <a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/StockBuy.php?GuruName=Third+Avenue+Value+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Third Avenue Value Fund;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Third Avenue Value Fund</a> (<a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/StockBuy.php?GuruName=Third+Avenue+Value+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Trades;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Trades</a>, <a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/holdings.php?GuruName=Third+Avenue+Value+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Portfolio;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Portfolio</a>)\'s portfolio comprises 29 stocks. The top holdings include 6.89% in Warrior Met Coal Inc (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/HCC/GF-Score/Warrior+Met+Coal+Inc\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:NYSE:HCC;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">NYSE:HCC</a>), 6.01% in Capstone Copper Corp (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TSX:CS/GF-Score/Warrior+Met+Coal+Inc\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:TSX:CS;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">TSX:CS</a>), 5.17% in easyJet PLC (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/LSE:EZJ/GF-Score/Warrior+Met+Coal+Inc\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:LSE:EZJ;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">LSE:EZJ</a>), 4.96% in Bayerische Motoren Werke AG (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/XTER:BMW/GF-Score/Warrior+Met+Coal+Inc\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:XTER:BMW;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">XTER:BMW</a>), and 4.85% in Tidewater Inc (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TDW/GF-Score/Warrior+Met+Coal+Inc\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:NYSE:TDW;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">NYSE:TDW</a>).</p>\n<figure class=\"caas-figure\">\n <div class=\"caas-figure-with-pb\" style=\"max-height: 419px\">\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"caas-img-container caas-img-loader\" style=\"padding-bottom:44%\">\n    <img class=\"caas-img caas-lazy has-preview\" alt=\"Third Avenue Value Fund Adjusts Portfolio, Warrior Met Coal Sees Significant Reduction\" data-src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/fLtW59481dvuBr4zCuJTsQ--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTQxOQ--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/us.finance.gurufocus/19252a0dc52b62986fcac77d06f46201\">\n    <noscript>\n     <img alt=\"Third Avenue Value Fund Adjusts Portfolio, Warrior Met Coal Sees Significant Reduction\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/fLtW59481dvuBr4zCuJTsQ--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTQxOQ--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/us.finance.gurufocus/19252a0dc52b62986fcac77d06f46201\" class=\"caas-img\">\n    </noscript>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"caption-wrapper caption-aligned-with-image\">\n  <figcaption class=\"caption-collapse\">\n   Third Avenue Value Fund Adjusts Portfolio, Warrior Met Coal Sees Significant Reduction\n  </figcaption>\n </div>\n</figure>\n<p>The fund\'s investments are primarily concentrated in eight industries out of the eleven total sectors: Basic Materials, Financial Services, Energy, Industrials, Consumer Cyclical, Technology, Communication Services, and Consumer Defensive.</p>\n<figure class=\"caas-figure\">\n <div class=\"caas-figure-with-pb\" style=\"max-height: 697px\">\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"caas-img-container caas-img-loader\" style=\"padding-bottom:73%\">\n    <img class=\"caas-img caas-lazy has-preview\" alt=\"Third Avenue Value Fund Adjusts Portfolio, Warrior Met Coal Sees Significant Reduction\" data-src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/tlO1hjnYt_gIO9l4oSu11g