ltr\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-lines js-progressbar\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-line c-mmp__indicator-line--range js-playback-range\" style=\"width:100%\"></span> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-line c-mmp__indicator-line--buffered js-playback-buffered\" style=\"width:0%\"></span> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-line c-mmp__indicator-line--tracked js-playback-tracked\" style=\"width:0%\"></span> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-line c-mmp__indicator-line--played js-playback-played\" style=\"width:0%\"></span> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-line c-mmp__indicator-line--live js-playback-live\"><span class=\"strip\"></span></span> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-btn ta-c js-progressbar-btn\"> <button class=\"c-mmp__indicator-btn-pointer\" type=\"button\"></button> </span> <span class=\"c-mmp__badge c-mmp__badge--tracked-time c-mmp__badge--hidden js-progressbar-indicator-badge\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left:0%\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__badge-text js-progressbar-indicator-badge-text\">0:00</span> </span> </span> </span> \n       </div> \n       <div class=\"c-mmp__cpanel-additional-controls\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__cpanel-additional-controls-volume js-volume-controls\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__cpanel-btn c-mmp__cpanel-btn--volume js-btn-volume\" title=\"volume\"> <span class=\"ico ico-volume-unmuted m-0\"></span> </span> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator c-mmp__indicator--vertical js-volume-panel\" dir=\"ltr\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-lines js-volumebar\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-line c-mmp__indicator-line--range js-volume-range\" style=\"height:100%\"></span> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-line c-mmp__indicator-line--volume js-volume-level\" style=\"height:0%\"></span> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-slider\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-btn ta-c c-mmp__indicator-btn--hidden js-volumebar-btn\"> <button class=\"c-mmp__indicator-btn-pointer\" type=\"button\"></button> </span> </span> </span> </span> </span> \n        <div class=\"c-mmp__cpanel-additional-controls-settings js-settings-controls\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__cpanel-btn c-mmp__cpanel-btn--settings-overlay js-btn-settings-overlay\" title=\"source switch\"> <span class=\"ico ico-settings m-0\"></span> </span> <span class=\"c-mmp__cpanel-btn c-mmp__cpanel-btn--settings-expand js-btn-settings-expand\" title=\"source switch\"> <span class=\"ico ico-settings m-0\"></span> </span> \n         <div class=\"c-mmp__expander c-mmp__expander--sources js-c-mmp__expander--sources\"> \n          <div class=\"c-mmp__expander-content js-sources\"></div> \n         </div> \n        </div> \n       </div> \n      </div> \n     </div> \n    </div> \n   </div> \n  </div> \n  <div class=\"media-download\"> \n   <div class=\"simple-menu\"> <span class=\"handler\"> <span class=\"ico ico-download\"></span> <span class=\"label\">Télécharger </span> <span class=\"ico ico-chevron-down\"></span> </span> \n    <div class=\"inner\"> \n     <ul class=\"subitems\"> \n      <li class=\"subitem\"> <a href=\"https://av.voanews.com/clips/VFR/2024/03/04/01000000-c0a8-0242-6723-08dc3c79c162_16k.mp3?download=1\" title=\"16 kbps | MP3\" class=\"handler\" onclick=\"FireAnalyticsTagEventOnDownload(this, \'audio\', 7513229, \'Centrafrique : les réactions suite à l\'arrestation de Mboli-Goumba\', null, \'Freeman Sipila\', \'2024\', \'03\', \'04\')\"> 16 kbps | MP3 </a> </li> \n      <li class=\"subitem\"> <a href=\"https://av.voanews.com/clips/VFR/2024/03/04/01000000-c0a8-0242-6723-08dc3c79c162_32k.mp3?download=1\" title=\"32 kbps | MP3\" class=\"handler\" onclick=\"FireAnalyticsTagEventOnDownload(this, \'audio\', 7513229, \'Centrafrique : les réactions suite à l\'arrestation de Mboli-Goumba\', null, \'Freeman Sipila\', \'2024\', \'03\', \'04\')\"> 32 kbps | MP3 </a> </li> \n      <li class=\"subitem\"> <a href=\"https://av.voanews.com/clips/VFR/2024/03/04/01000000-c0a8-0242-6723-08dc3c79c162_48k.mp3?download=1\" title=\"48 kbps | MP3\" class=\"handler\" onclick=\"FireAnalyticsTagEventOnDownload(this, \'audio\', 7513229, \'Centrafrique : les réactions suite à l\'arrestation de Mboli-Goumba\', null, \'Freeman Sipila\', \'2024\', \'03\', \'04\')\"> 48 kbps | MP3 </a> </li> \n     </ul> \n    </div> \n   </div> \n  </div> <button class=\"btn btn--link btn-popout-player\" data-default-display=\"block\" data-popup-url=\"/pp/7513229/ppt0.html\" title=\"Pop-out player\"> <span class=\"ico ico-arrow-top-right\"></span> <span class=\"text\">Pop-out player</span> </button> \n </div> \n</div> \n<p>Le régime de M. Touadéra <em>\"réprime la société civile, les médias et les partis politiques d\'opposition\"</em>, écrivait Human Rights Watch (HRW) en avril 2023, invoquant <em>\"de graves préoccupations sur des risques en termes de violations des droits humains et de réduction de l\'espace démocratique et de la liberté d\'expression\"</em>.</p> \n<p>L\'ONG exhortait aussi le pouvoir de M. Touadéra à <em>\"garantir l\'indépendance de la justice pour s\'assurer que les responsables qui attaquent les détracteurs du gouvernement soient amenés à rendre des comptes\".</em> M. Touadéra a fait modifier la Constitution en juillet 2023 par un référendum boycotté par l\'opposition, pour s\'autoriser à briguer un troisième mandat en 2025.</p> \n<p>Elu en 2016 en pleine guerre civile, il avait été réélu en 2020 dans des conditions contestées par l\'opposition et dans un pays dont une grande majorité du territoire était contrôlée par des rebelles, que son armée a ensuite repoussés grâce à l\'aide de Moscou et l\'intervention massive de mercenaires russes de Wagner.</p>', 'Une figure de l\'opposition en Centrafrique, Crépin Mboli Goumba, a été condamnée mercredi à un an de prison avec sursis pour diffamation et outrage à magistrats, dans un pays où toute voix dissonante est réprimée par le pouvoir du président Faustin Archange Touadéra.', 99350, 0, '2024-03-27 13:37:04', '2024-03-27 14:00:35', 6);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26888, 'How To Earn $500 A Month From Apple Stock', '<figure class=\"caas-figure\">\n <div class=\"caas-figure-with-pb\" style=\"max-height: 540px\">\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"caas-img-container\" style=\"padding-bottom:56%\">\n    <img class=\"caas-img has-preview\" alt src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/wTtW0YpSRCvZ4fJmH8LdIQ--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTU0MA--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/Benzinga/4adb91959b3e8f30e1d04f6fce1d3384\" data-src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/wTtW0YpSRCvZ4fJmH8LdIQ--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTU0MA--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/Benzinga/4adb91959b3e8f30e1d04f6fce1d3384\">\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>Apple Inc.</strong> (NASDAQ: <a class=\"link \" href=\"http://finance.yahoo.com/q?s=AAPL\" data-ylk=\"slk:AAPL;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">AAPL</a>) shares closed slightly lower <a href=\"https://www.benzinga.com/news/24/03/37936693/apple-faces-doj-scrutiny-but-not-these-3-under-the-radar-names?utm_campaign=partner_feed&amp;utm_source=yahooFinance&amp;utm_medium=partner_feed&amp;utm_content=site\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:during Tuesday’s session;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">during Tuesday’s session</a>.</p>\n<p>MacRumors has reported that Apple is potentially introducing a “custom routes” feature in&nbsp;iOS 18. The discovery was made through a review of code <a href=\"https://www.benzinga.com/news/24/03/37950998/apple-might-finally-introduce-this-much-requested-maps-feature-in-ios-18?utm_campaign=partner_feed&amp;utm_source=yahooFinance&amp;utm_medium=partner_feed&amp;utm_content=site\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:associated with Apple Maps;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">associated with Apple Maps</a>.</p>\n<p>This feature will allow users to enter their chosen navigation paths, marking a significant expansion from the current pre-selected routes.</p>\n<p>With the recent buzz around Apple, some investors may be eyeing potential gains from the company’s dividends too. As of now, Apple offers an annual dividend yield of 0.57%, which is a quarterly dividend amount of 24 cents per share (96 cents a year).</p>\n<div class=\"caas-da \">\n <div data-wf-benji-page-context=\"{&quot;pageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/earn-500-month-apple-stock-170539964.html&quot;,&quot;spaceid&quot;:&quot;1187300073&quot;,&quot;site&quot;:&quot;finance&quot;,&quot;hashtag&quot;:&quot;investments;stocks;finance&quot;,&quot;lmsid&quot;:&quot;a0Vd0000003tp8ZEAQ&quot;,&quot;pct&quot;:&quot;story&quot;}\" data-wf-benji-wafer-config=\"{}\" data-wf-benji-config=\"{&quot;positions&quot;:{&quot;INARTICLE-0ae87c21-b5e6-39ba-8c84-6d8dd5dbae721711562450668&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;INARTICLE-0ae87c21-b5e6-39ba-8c84-6d8dd5dbae721711562450668&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/22888152279/${REGION}/yfin/ros/dt/${REGION}_yfin_ros_dt_mid_center&quot;,&quot;region&quot;:&quot;index&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;fluid&quot;,&quot;kvs&quot;:{&quot;loc&quot;:&quot;mid_center&quot;},&quot;disableRefresh&quot;:true}}}\" id=\"sda-INARTICLE-0ae87c21-b5e6-39ba-8c84-6d8dd5dbae721711562450668\" class=\"wafer-benji caas-sda-benji-ad\" data-wf-trigger=\"onLoad\" data-wf-margin=\"100 0\">\n  <div id=\"sdaAdvText-INARTICLE-0ae87c21-b5e6-39ba-8c84-6d8dd5dbae721711562450668\" class=\"caas-sda-adv-text\">\n   ADVERTISEMENT\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"INARTICLE-0ae87c21-b5e6-39ba-8c84-6d8dd5dbae721711562450668\"></div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<p>So, how can investors exploit its dividend yield to pocket a regular $500 monthly?</p>\n<p><strong>To earn $500 per month or $6,000 annually from dividends alone, you would need an investment of approximately $1,060,688 or around 6,250 shares. For a more modest $100 per month or $1,200 per year, you would need $212,138 or around 1,250 shares.</strong></p>\n<p>Read This: <a href=\"https://www.benzinga.com/news/24/03/37932398/top-3-energy-stocks-that-may-keep-you-up-at-night-in-q1?utm_campaign=partner_feed&amp;utm_source=yahooFinance&amp;utm_medium=partner_feed&amp;utm_content=site\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Top 3 Energy Stocks That May Keep You Up At Night In Q1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \"><em> Top 3 Energy Stocks That May Keep You Up At Night In Q1 </em></a></p>\n<p><strong>To calculate: </strong> Divide the desired annual income ($6,000 or $1,200) by the dividend ($0.96 in this case). So, $6,000 / $0.96 = 6,250 ($500 per month), and $1,200 / $0.96 = 1,250 shares ($100 per month).</p>\n<p>Note that dividend yield can change on a rolling basis, as the dividend payment and the stock price both fluctuate over time.</p>\n<p><strong>How that works: </strong> The dividend yield is computed by dividing the annual dividend payment by the stock\'s current price.</p>\n<p>For example, if a stock pays an annual dividend of $2 and is currently priced at $50, the dividend yield would be 4% ($2/$50). However, if the stock price increases to $60, the dividend yield drops to 3.33% ($2/$60). Conversely, if the stock price falls to $40, the dividend yield rises to 5% ($2/$40).</p>\n<p>Similarly, changes in the dividend payment can impact the yield. If a company increases its dividend, the yield will also increase, provided the stock price stays the same. Conversely, if the dividend payment decreases, so will the yield.</p>\n<div class=\"caas-readmore caas-readmore-collapse\">\n <button class=\"link caas-button collapse-button\" data-ylk=\"elm:readmore;slk:Story continues\">Story continues</button>\n</div>\n<p><strong>AAPL Price Action:</strong> Shares of Apple were up 1.5% to $172.38 at the time of publication Wednesday.</p>\n<p><em>Read More: <a href=\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/24/03/37927495/jim-cramer-says-dont-sell-this-beauty-brand-believes-kkr-and-blackstone-can-make-more-mo?utm_campaign=partner_feed&amp;utm_source=yahooFinance&amp;utm_medium=partner_feed&amp;utm_content=site\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Jim Cramer Says Don\'t Sell This Beauty Brand, Believes KKR And Blackstone \'Can Make More Money\';elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \"> Jim Cramer Says Don\'t Sell This Beauty Brand, Believes KKR And Blackstone \'Can Make More Money\' </a></em></p>\n<p><em>Photo: Shutterstock.com</em></p>\n<p>\"ACTIVE INVESTORS\' SECRET WEAPON\" Supercharge Your Stock Market Game with the #1 \"news &amp; everything else\" trading tool: Benzinga Pro - <a href=\"https://pro.benzinga.com/register/?utm_source=yahoo_finance\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Click here to start Your 14-Day Trial Now!;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Click here to start Your 14-Day Trial Now!</a></p>\n<p>Get the latest stock analysis from Benzinga?</p>\n<p>This article <a href=\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/24/03/37951331/how-to-earn-500-a-month-from-apple-stock\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:How To Earn $500 A Month From Apple Stock;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">How To Earn $500 A Month From Apple Stock</a> originally appeared on <a href=\"https://www.benzinga.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Benzinga.com;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Benzinga.com</a></p>\n<p><i>© 2024 Benzinga.com. Benzinga does not provide investment advice. All rights reserved.</i></p>', NULL, 86733, 0, '2024-03-27 13:05:39', '2024-03-27 14:00:51', 10);
