" class=\"link \">Portfolio</a>), known for its disciplined investment approach in larger capitalization Canadian companies, has revealed its fourth quarter moves for 2023. The fund, which is designed for investors seeking long-term growth and can handle equity volatility, focuses on wealth-creating companies with strong management teams, purchasing these at discounts to their intrinsic values. The fund\'s strategy involves a research-driven, bottom-up process, and it maintains a long-term holding period to optimize investor returns and minimize transaction costs.</p>\n<figure class=\"caas-figure\">\n <div class=\"caas-figure-with-pb\" style=\"max-height: 697px\">\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"caas-img-container caas-img-loader\" style=\"padding-bottom:73%\">\n    <img class=\"caas-img caas-lazy has-preview\" alt=\"AltaGas Ltd Soars as Mawer Canadian Equity Fund Increases Stake by Over 1000%\" data-src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/BJRQ5ujyEr_pHrflKUIE8A--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTY5Nw--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/us.finance.gurufocus/04e55a551b749548bf36ecbeb36d0672\">\n    <noscript>\n     <img alt=\"AltaGas Ltd Soars as Mawer Canadian Equity Fund Increases Stake by Over 1000%\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/BJRQ5ujyEr_pHrflKUIE8A--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTY5Nw--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/us.finance.gurufocus/04e55a551b749548bf36ecbeb36d0672\" class=\"caas-img\">\n    </noscript>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"caption-wrapper caption-aligned-with-image\">\n  <figcaption class=\"caption-collapse\">\n   AltaGas Ltd Soars as Mawer Canadian Equity Fund Increases Stake by Over 1000%\n  </figcaption>\n </div>\n</figure>\n<h3>Summary of New Buys</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/StockBuy.php?GuruName=Mawer+Canadian+Equity+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Mawer Canadian Equity Fund;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Mawer Canadian Equity Fund</a> (<a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/StockBuy.php?GuruName=Mawer+Canadian+Equity+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Trades;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Trades</a>, <a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/holdings.php?GuruName=Mawer+Canadian+Equity+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Portfolio;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Portfolio</a>) expanded its portfolio with 5 new stock additions, including:</p>\n<div class=\"caas-da \">\n <div data-wf-benji-page-context=\"{&quot;pageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/altagas-ltd-soars-mawer-canadian-170200862.html&quot;,&quot;spaceid&quot;:&quot;1187300073&quot;,&quot;site&quot;:&quot;finance&quot;,&quot;hashtag&quot;:&quot;investments;stocks;finance;stocks&quot;,&quot;lmsid&quot;:&quot;a0Vd0000003tnQZEAY&quot;,&quot;pct&quot;:&quot;story&quot;}\" data-wf-benji-wafer-config=\"{}\" data-wf-benji-config=\"{&quot;positions&quot;:{&quot;INARTICLE-b2c0a294-8e9f-3873-94d6-503f92bd82341711562451177&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;INARTICLE-b2c0a294-8e9f-3873-94d6-503f92bd82341711562451177&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/22888152279/${REGION}/yfin/ros/dt/${REGION}_yfin_ros_dt_mid_center&quot;,&quot;region&quot;:&quot;index&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;fluid&quot;,&quot;kvs&quot;:{&quot;loc&quot;:&quot;mid_center&quot;},&quot;disableRefresh&quot;:true}}}\" id=\"sda-INARTICLE-b2c0a294-8e9f-3873-94d6-503f92bd82341711562451177\" class=\"wafer-benji caas-sda-benji-ad\" data-wf-trigger=\"onLoad\" data-wf-margin=\"100 0\">\n  <div id=\"sdaAdvText-INARTICLE-b2c0a294-8e9f-3873-94d6-503f92bd82341711562451177\" class=\"caas-sda-adv-text\">\n   ADVERTISEMENT\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"INARTICLE-b2c0a294-8e9f-3873-94d6-503f92bd82341711562451177\"></div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p>Intact Financial Corp (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TSX:IFC/GF-Score/Royal+Bank+of+Canada\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:TSX:IFC;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">TSX:IFC</a>), acquiring 452,126 shares, which now represent 2.61% of the portfolio, valued at C$92.17 million.</p></li>\n <li><p>Restaurant Brands International Inc (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TSX:QSR/GF-Score/Royal+Bank+of+Canada\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:TSX:QSR;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">TSX:QSR</a>), with 602,600 shares, making up about 1.77% of the portfolio, valued at C$62.39 million.</p></li>\n <li><p>Stella-Jones Inc (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TSX:SJ/GF-Score/Royal+Bank+of+Canada\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:TSX:SJ;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">TSX:SJ</a>), adding 433,224 shares, accounting for 0.95% of the portfolio, valued at C$33.41 million.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Key Position Increases</h3>\n<p>The fund also significantly increased its stakes in 10 stocks, with the most noteworthy being:</p>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p>AltaGas Ltd (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TSX:ALA/GF-Score/Royal+Bank+of+Canada\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:TSX:ALA;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">TSX:ALA</a>), where the fund boosted its holding by an additional 3,661,827 shares, bringing the total to 4,012,234 shares. This represents a staggering 1045.02% increase in share count and a 2.88% impact on the current portfolio, valued at C$111.62 million.</p></li>\n <li><p>RB Global Inc (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TSX:RBA/GF-Score/Royal+Bank+of+Canada\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:TSX:RBA;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">TSX:RBA</a>), with an additional 289,100 shares, increasing the total to 937,300 shares. This adjustment marks a 44.6% increase in share count, valued at C$83.11 million.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Summary of Sold Out Positions</h3>\n<p>The fund completely exited 4 holdings in the fourth quarter of 2023, including:</p>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p>BCE Inc (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TSX:BCE/GF-Score/Royal+Bank+of+Canada\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:TSX:BCE;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">TSX:BCE</a>), selling all 1,360,018 shares, which had a -2.24% impact on the portfolio.</p></li>\n <li><p>Enbridge Inc (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TSX:ENB/GF-Score/Royal+Bank+of+Canada\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:TSX:ENB;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">TSX:ENB</a>), liquidating all 898,588 shares, resulting in a -1.21% impact on the portfolio.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"caas-readmore caas-readmore-collapse\">\n <button class=\"link caas-button collapse-button\" data-ylk=\"elm:readmore;slk:Story continues\">Story continues</button>\n</div>\n<h3>Key Position Reductions</h3>\n<p>Reductions were made in 27 stocks, with significant changes in:</p>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p>Bank of Montreal (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TSX:BMO/GF-Score/Royal+Bank+of+Canada\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:TSX:BMO;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">TSX:BMO</a>), reduced by 364,640 shares, leading to a -28.85% decrease in shares and a -1.19% impact on the portfolio. The stock traded at an average price of C$115.82 during the quarter.</p></li>\n <li><p>Suncor Energy Inc (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TSX:SU/GF-Score/Royal+Bank+of+Canada\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:TSX:SU;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">TSX:SU</a>), cut by 1,021,800 shares, resulting in a -33.22% reduction in shares and a -1.08% impact on the portfolio. The stock had a robust return of 17.94% over the past 3 months.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Portfolio Overview</h3>\n<p>As of the end of Q4 2023, <a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/StockBuy.php?GuruName=Mawer+Canadian+Equity+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Mawer Canadian Equity Fund;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Mawer Canadian Equity Fund</a> (<a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/StockBuy.php?GuruName=Mawer+Canadian+Equity+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Trades;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Trades</a>, <a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/holdings.php?GuruName=Mawer+Canadian+Equity+Fund\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Portfolio;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Portfolio</a>)\'s portfolio consisted of 42 stocks, with top holdings including 5.38% in Royal Bank of Canada (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TSX:RY/GF-Score/Royal+Bank+of+Canada\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:TSX:RY;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">TSX:RY</a>), 4.76% in Canadian Natural Resources Ltd (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TSX:CNQ/GF-Score/Royal+Bank+of+Canada\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:TSX:CNQ;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">TSX:CNQ</a>), and 4.66% in The Toronto-Dominion Bank (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TSX:TD/GF-Score/Royal+Bank+of+Canada\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:TSX:TD;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">TSX:TD</a>). The fund\'s investments are mainly concentrated across 10 industries, reflecting a diverse approach to sector allocation.</p>\n<figure class=\"caas-figure\">\n <div class=\"caas-figure-with-pb\" style=\"max-height: 419px\">\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"caas-img-container caas-img-loader\" style=\"padding-bottom:44%\">\n    <img class=\"caas-img caas-lazy has-preview\" alt=\"AltaGas Ltd Soars as Mawer Canadian Equity Fund Increases Stake by Over 1000%\" data-src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/PqeIAP1gyD22y0Jc9UFsiQ--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTQxOQ--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/us.finance.gurufocus/a79b215905322f756676bacc98afafdc\">\n    <noscript>\n     <img alt=\"AltaGas Ltd Soars as Mawer Canadian Equity Fund Increases Stake by Over 1000%\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/PqeIAP1gyD22y0Jc9UFsiQ--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTQxOQ--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/us.finance.gurufocus/a79b215905322f756676bacc98afafdc\" class=\"caas-img\">\n    </noscript>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"caption-wrapper caption-aligned-with-image\">\n  <figcaption class=\"caption-collapse\">\n   AltaGas Ltd Soars as Mawer Canadian Equity Fund Increases Stake by Over 1000%\n  </figcaption>\n </div>\n</figure>\n<p><em>This article, generated by GuruFocus, is designed to provide general insights and is not tailored financial advice. Our commentary is rooted in historical data and analyst projections, utilizing an impartial methodology, and is not intended to serve as specific investment guidance. It does not formulate a recommendation to purchase or divest any stock and does not consider individual investment objectives or financial circumstances. Our objective is to deliver long-term, fundamental data-driven analysis. Be aware that our analysis might not incorporate the most recent, price-sensitive company announcements or qualitative information. GuruFocus holds no position in the stocks mentioned herein.</em></p>\n<p>This article first appeared on <a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/news/2398592/altagas-ltd-soars-as-mawer-canadian-equity-fund-increases-stake-by-over-1000?r=caf6fe0e0db70d936033da5461e60141\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:GuruFocus;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">GuruFocus</a>.<br></p>', NULL, 40173, 0, '2024-03-27 13:02:00', '2024-03-27 14:00:51', 10);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26890, 'Le cancer du sein, un problème de santé publique au Burkina Faso', '<p>A l’université de Ouagadougou, Hamed Ko vient de décrocher son diplôme de docteur en médecine. Il a travaillé sur le bilan d’extension initial du cancer du sein. Son étude multicentrique a porté sur plus de 500 de cancers du sein dans trois grands hôpitaux de la capitale.</p>\n<div class=\"wsw__embed\"> \n <div class=\"media-pholder media-pholder--video \"> \n  <div class=\"c-sticky-container\" data-poster=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-bb1c-08dbd002b06f_w250_r1.jpg\"> \n   <div class=\"c-sticky-element\" data-sp_api=\"pangea-video\" data-persistent data-persistent-browse-out> \n    <div class=\"c-mmp c-mmp--enabled c-mmp--loading c-mmp--video c-mmp--standard c-mmp--has-poster c-sticky-element__swipe-el\" data-player_id=\"\" data-title=\"Carnet de santé : Octobre rose\" data-hide-title=\"False\" data-breakpoint_s=\"320\" data-breakpoint_m=\"640\" data-breakpoint_l=\"992\" data-hlsjs-src=\"/Scripts/responsive/hls.b\" data-bypass-dash-for-vod=\"true\" data-bypass-dash-for-live-video=\"true\" data-bypass-dash-for-live-audio=\"true\"> \n     <div class=\"c-mmp__poster js-poster c-mmp__poster--video\"> \n      <img src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-bb1c-08dbd002b06f_w250_r1.jpg\" alt=\"Carnet de santé : Octobre rose\" title=\"Carnet de santé : Octobre rose\"> \n     </div> <a class=\"c-mmp__fallback-link\" href=\"https://av.voanews.com/Videoroot/Pangeavideo/2023/10/0/01/01000000-c0a8-0242-5b28-08dbd093bc13_240p.mp4\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__fallback-link-icon\"> <span class=\"ico ico-play\"></span> </span> </a> \n     <div class=\"c-spinner\"> \n      <img src=\"/Content/responsive/img/player-spinner.png\" alt=\"Attendez s\'il vous plaît \" title=\"Attendez s\'il vous plaît \"> \n     </div> <span class=\"c-mmp__big_play_btn js-btn-play-big\"> <span class=\"ico ico-play\"></span> </span> \n     <div class=\"c-mmp__player\"> \n      <video p