stocks to buy. In addition, please check out our <a href=\"https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/hedge-fund-investor-letters-q4-2023-1244520/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:hedge fund investor letters Q4 2023;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">hedge fund investor letters Q4 2023</a>&nbsp;page for more investor letters from hedge funds and other leading investors.</p>\n<p>Suggested Articles:</p>\n<ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n <li><p><a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/30-least-developed-countries-characteristics-144653462.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:30 Least Developed Countries and Their Characteristics;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;outcm:mb_qualified_link;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;\" class=\"link  yahoo-link\"><span>30 Least Developed Countries and Their Characteristics</span></a></p></li>\n <li><p><a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/21-great-business-ideas-nurse-201833913.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:21 Great Business Ideas for Nurse Entrepreneurs;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;outcm:mb_qualified_link;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;\" class=\"link  yahoo-link\"><span>21 Great Business Ideas for Nurse Entrepreneurs</span></a></p></li>\n <li><p><a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/15-biggest-semiconductor-companies-suppliers-202116446.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:15 Biggest Semiconductor Companies and Suppliers in Europe;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;outcm:mb_qualified_link;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;\" class=\"link  yahoo-link\"><span>15 Biggest Semiconductor Companies and Suppliers in Europe</span></a></p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Disclosure: None. This article is originally published at&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/should-you-consider-selling-nasdaq-ndaq-1281780/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:Insider Monkey;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Insider Monkey</a>.</p>', NULL, 70176, 0, '2024-03-28 08:31:19', '2024-03-28 09:00:53', 10);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26979, 'UBS flags commercial real estate downturn as a top risk', '<p>By Noele Illien</p>\n<p>ZURICH (Reuters) - UBS flagged on Thursday the downturn in commercial real estate markets as one of the \"top and emerging risks\" facing the Swiss bank, as higher borrowing costs and a post-pandemic slump in demand for office space hit the sector.</p>\n<p>Commercial property markets in the United States and Europe are in the grip of the biggest slowdown since the 2008-9 crash.</p>\n<p>\"Adverse effects on valuations from higher interest rates and structural decline in demand for office and retail space may trigger broader impacts given bank and non-bank lenders\' material balance sheet exposure to the sector,\" the bank said in its 2023 annual report published on Thursday.</p>\n<div class=\"caas-da \">\n <div data-wf-benji-page-context=\"{&quot;pageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/ubs-flags-commercial-real-estate-122747843.html&quot;,&quot;spaceid&quot;:&quot;1187300073&quot;,&quot;site&quot;:&quot;finance&quot;,&quot;hashtag&quot;:&quot;realestate;finance&quot;,&quot;lmsid&quot;:&quot;a0770000002GZ5iAAG&quot;,&quot;pct&quot;:&quot;story&quot;}\" data-wf-benji-wafer-config=\"{}\" data-wf-benji-config=\"{&quot;positions&quot;:{&quot;INARTICLE-a738591f-0387-3d57-bb9c-668375f7a94e1711630853059&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;INARTICLE-a738591f-0387-3d57-bb9c-668375f7a94e1711630853059&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/22888152279/${REGION}/yfin/ros/dt/${REGION}_yfin_ros_dt_mid_center&quot;,&quot;region&quot;:&quot;index&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;fluid&quot;,&quot;kvs&quot;:{&quot;loc&quot;:&quot;mid_center&quot;},&quot;disableRefresh&quot;:true}}}\" id=\"sda-INARTICLE-a738591f-0387-3d57-bb9c-668375f7a94e1711630853059\" class=\"wafer-benji caas-sda-benji-ad\" data-wf-trigger=\"onLoad\" data-wf-margin=\"100 0\">\n  <div id=\"sdaAdvText-INARTICLE-a738591f-0387-3d57-bb9c-668375f7a94e1711630853059\" class=\"caas-sda-adv-text\">\n   ADVERTISEMENT\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"INARTICLE-a738591f-0387-3d57-bb9c-668375f7a94e1711630853059\"></div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<p>UBS said its risk exposure to the sector across the group increased to $55.09 billion in 2023 from $47.1 billion in 2022, largely due to the acquisition of its rival Credit Suisse. Several other big European banks have larger loan exposures to commercial real estate, official data shows.</p>\n<p>UBS defines \"top and emerging risks\" as those which have the potential to materialise within one year and could significantly affect the group. Other risks detailed on Thursday included inflation and geopolitics.</p>\n<p>Commercial real estate did not feature among the top risks UBS flagged in its last annual report.</p>\n<p>The bank did not give a breakdown to show its exposure to U.S. commercial real estate, a market which has particularly struggled.</p>\n<p>Valuations have plummeted there, putting pressure on indebted developers and some regional U.S. banks as well as heavily exposed specialist German lenders.</p>\n<p>Analysts have said that the hit to major banks globally of a further downturn should be manageable with a small impact on their earnings.</p>\n<p>The International Monetary Fund said on Thursday that banks needed to be vigilant about real estate risks in Switzerland.</p>\n<p>\"The financial sector is resilient with strong buffers, but vulnerabilities from the real estate sector remain,\" the IMF said after concluding its review of the Swiss economy.</p>\n<div class=\"caas-readmore caas-readmore-collapse\">\n <button class=\"link caas-button collapse-button\" data-ylk=\"elm:readmore;slk:Story continues\">Story continues</button>\n</div>\n<p>In its annual report, UBS said that greater exposure to Swiss commercial real estate had also increased climate-related transition risks.</p>\n<p>That was because Switzerland last year passed the Climate and Innovation Act, which is set to impact energy efficiency rules, the bank said.</p>\n<p>Lenders are trying to reduce emissions linked to their property lending, a major source of carbon emissions.</p>\n<p>Some European bank executives have called on governments to toughen up rules around decarbonising real estate, warning that without that they will struggle to hit climate targets.</p>\n<p>UBS said on Thursday it was targeting a 45% reduction in emissions linked to its Swiss residential property book by 2030 and 48% for its commercial business.</p>\n<p>($1 = 0.9269 euros)</p>\n<p>(Reporting by Noele Illien; Editing by Tommy Reggiori Wilkes and Susan Fenton)</p>', NULL, 23905, 0, '2024-03-28 08:27:47', '2024-03-28 09:00:53', 10);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26980, '\'ดิสนีย์-รัฐฟลอริดา\' จับมือประนีประนอมปมขัดแย้งพื้นที่ดิสนีย์เวิลด์', '<p><strong>บริษัทความบันเทิงรายใหญ่ของสหรัฐฯ วอลท์ ดิสนีย์ (Walt Disney) และรัฐบาลท้องถิ่นรัฐฟลอริดา สามารถบรรลุความตกลงประนีประนอมยอมความเพื่อยุติคดีการฟ้องร้องต่อศาลรัฐฟลอริดา เรื่องสิทธิครอบครองพื้นที่เขตปกครองพิเศษซึ่งรวมถึงสวนสนุกวอลท์ ดิสนีย์ เวิลด์ (Walt Disney World)</strong></p> \n<p>ดีสนีย์ยังได้ตกลงระงับการฟ้องร้องผู้ว่าการรัฐฟลอริดา รอน เดอซานติส ในขณะที่ทั้งสองฝ่ายพยายามหาทางออกร่วมกันเรื่องสัญญาฉบับใหม่ของสวนสนุกระดับโลกแห่งนี้ด้วย</p> \n<p>เดอซานติส และดีสนีย์ซึ่งเป็นผู้จ้างงานรายใหญ่ที่สุดของรัฐฟลอริดา เริ่มมีความขัดแย้งทางกฎหมายกันตั้งแต่ปี 2022 เมื่ออดีตซีอีโอของดีสนีย์ บ๊อบ ชาเปก กล่าววิจารณ์สภารัฐฟลอริดาที่พยายามออกกฎหมายจำกัดบทเรียนในชั้นเรียนที่เกี่ยวกับรสนิยมทางเพศ (sexual orientation) หรืออัตลักษณ์ทางเพศ ซึ่งมีชื่อเรียกกันทั่วไปว่าเป็นกฎหมาย Don’t Say Gay หรือ กฎหมายห้ามเรียกว่าเกย์</p> \n<p>โดยทางคณะกรรมการรัฐฟลอริดาที่เดอซานติสเป็นผู้แต่งตั้งให้ทำหน้าที่ดูแลโครงการต่าง ๆ รอบสวนสนุกดิสนีย์ เวิลด์ พยายามถอดสิทธิ์ของวอลท์ ดิสนีย์ ในการปกครองพื้นที่ขนาดใหญ่ของตัวเองซึ่งเป็นที่ตั้งสวนสนุกและโรงแรมหลายแห่งมานานหลายสิบปี</p> \n<p>ภายใต้ข้อตกลงยอมความในวันพุธ ดิสนีย์ตกลงว่าจะไม่ท้าทายมุมมองของคณะกรรมการดังกล่าวที่ว่า แผนการใช้ที่ดินในบริเวณที่ตั้งของดิสนีย์ เวิลด์ ซึ่งจัดทำโดยคณะกรรมการชุดก่อนนั้นไม่มีผลบังคับใช้แล้ว นั่นหมายความว่าจะนำแผนใหม่ที่ร่างขึ้นเมื่อปี 2020 มาเป็นโครงร่างสำหรับการจัดทำแผนใช้ที่ดินของสวนสนุกและร้านค้าต่าง ๆ แทน</p> \n<p>โดยสมาชิกคณะกรรมการ Central Florida Tourism Oversight District ของรัฐฟลอริดา รับรองข้อตกลงยอมความนี้ที่การประชุมในวันพุธ</p> \n<p>ที่ดินที่เป็นประเด็นต่อสู้ระหว่างรัฐฟลอริดาและวอลท์ ดิสนีย์ นั้นปัจจุบันมีชื่อว่า Reedy Creek Improvement District (RCID) และครอบคลุมพื้นที่ราว 101 ตารางกิโลเมตรในออเรนจ์เคาน์ตี้และโอซีโอลาเคาน์ตี้ ซึ่งถูกจัดตั้งขึ้นตั้งแต่เมื่อปี ค.ศ. 1967 ตามคำร้องของดิสนีย์ที่ว่า บริษัทมีแผนจะสร้างสวนสนุกขนาดใหญ่ในบริเวณดังกล่าว</p> \n<p>หลังจากนั้น บริษัทแห่งนี้ก็สร้างสวนสนุกขึ้นมาถึง 4 แห่ง สวนน้ำอีก 2 แห่งและโรงแรมหลายสิบแห่ง รวมทั้งภัตตาคารและสถานที่ให้บริการความบันเทิงอีกมากมายที่สามารถดึงดูดผู้คนเป็นสิบ ๆ ล้านให้เข้ามาท่องเที่ยวพักผ่อนได้ในแต่ละปี</p> \n<p>ที่ผ่านมา ดิสนีย์เป็นผู้แต่งตั้งคณะกรรมการทำหน้าที่ดูแล RCID มาโดยตลอด โดยกรรมการชุดนี้มีอำนาจเหมือนกับรัฐบาลระดับเคาน์ตี้ของสหรัฐฯ ซึ่งก็คือสามารถตั้งและจัดเก็บภาษีและบริหารงบประมาณผ่านการออกตราสารกู้ยืมได้ รวมทั้งเป็นผู้ดูแลหน่วยงานตำรวจ หน่วยดับเพลิงและหน่วยฉุกเฉิน และงานโยธาและสาธารณูปโภคต่าง ๆ เช่น รถ ระบบไฟฟ้าและระบบกำจัดน้ำเสีย เป็นต้น</p> \n<p>นอกจากนั้น RCID นั้นถูกจัดตั้งมาให้ดิสนีย์ไม่ต้องถูกควบคุมโดยกฎเกณฑ์ทั้งหลายของรัฐ ซึ่งรวมถึงกฎหมายตรวจสอบอาคารและด้านที่ดินด้วย</p> \n<ul> \n <li><em>ที่มา: รอยเตอร์</em></li> \n</ul>', NULL, 65938, 0, '2024-03-27 17:34:06', '2024-03-28 09:00:54', 11);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26981, 'Các đại sứ EU đạt thỏa thuận mới về nhập khẩu thực phẩm Ukraine', '<p>Các đại sứ của các nước trong Liên hiệp Châu Âu đạt được thỏa thuận với các điều khoản sửa đổi hôm thứ Tư 27/3 để gia hạn nhập khẩu thực phẩm miễn thuế từ Ukraine - với những hạn chế nhất định - sau khi một số quốc gia phàn nàn rằng thỏa thuận ban đầu có nguy cơ gây bất ổn cho thị trường nông sản của khối.</p> \n<p> </p> \n<p>Thỏa thuận giờ đây được chuyển đến Nghị viện châu Âu, các nhà ngoại giao dự báo rằng ở đó sẽ có những đòi hỏi phải bổ sung thêm các hạn chế, giữa lúc EU tranh cãi về việc cần tiếp tục miễn thuế như thế nào sau khi đã ban hành quy định miễn thuế hồi năm 2022 để trợ giúp nền kinh tế Ukraine sau cuộc xâm lược của Nga.</p> \n<p> </p> \n<p>Một số nhóm nông nghiệp EU và các quốc gia như Pháp, Ba Lan cho rằng cần phải thắt chặt các biện pháp để tránh làm cho nông sản EU mất khả năng cạnh tranh. Ukraine và các nước khác lập luận rằng các mặt hàng nhập khẩu của Ukraine ít ảnh hưởng đến thị trường EU.</p> \n<p> </p> \n<p>Một nhà ngoại giao EU nói rằng thỏa thuận mới - có hiệu lực đến tháng 6/2025 - có nội dung tương tự như thỏa thuận tạm thời được ký vào tuần trước nhưng đã thay đổi khoảng thời gian tham chiếu được sử dụng để xác định thời điểm áp dụng thuế đối với một số sản phẩm.</p> \n<p> </p> \n<p>Thỏa thuận ban đầu quy định rằng thuế quan sẽ áp dụng đối với gia cầm, trứng, đường, yến mạch, ngô, ngũ cốc và mật ong nếu nhập khẩu vượt quá mức trung bình của năm 2022 và 2023.</p> \n<p> </p> \n<p>Nhà ngoại giao nói rằng có thỏa hiệp là sẽ mở rộng thời gian tham chiếu để bao gồm nửa cuối năm 2021. Điều đó làm giảm mức trần áp dụng thuế quan.</p> \n<p> </p> \n<p>Bỉ, nước giữ chức chủ tịch luân phiên của EU, nhận xét rằng thỏa thuận này đảm bảo \"một cách tiếp cận cân bằng giữa trợ giúp Ukraine và bảo vệ thị trường nông sản EU\".</p> \n<p> </p> \n<p>Ước tính Ukraine sẽ mất khoản thu hàng năm là khoảng 330 triệu euro (357 triệu USD) - mặc dù vậy, việc tiếp tục đình chỉ thuế quan mang lại giá trị lớn hơn nhiều cho Kyiv.</p>', NULL, 69855, 0, '2024-03-27 21:57:15', '2024-03-28 09:00:58', 12);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26982, 'Dirjen Pajak: Rencana Kenaikan Tarif PPN Jadi 12 Persen Masih Dikaji', '<span class=\"dateline\">JAKARTA —&nbsp;</span> \n<p>Direktur Jenderal Pajak Kementerian Keuangan Suryo Utomo mengatakan kenaikan tarif pajak pertambahan nilai (PPN) menjadi 12 persen sedianya telah diatur di dalam UU nomor 7 tahun 2021 tentang Harmonisasi Peraturan Perpajakan (HPP). Dalam aturan tersebut kenaikan tarif PPN ini akan diberlakukan mulai1 Januari 2025.<br> <br> Meski begitu, katanya, pemerintah akan mengkaji ulang pemberlakuan tarif baru PPN dengan mempertimbangan beberapa faktor. Sebagai catatan, PPN yang berlaku saat ini adalah 11 persen.<br> <br> “Namun demikian berkenaan dengan adanya transisi pemerintahan, oleh karena itu perlu fatsun (etika, red) politik untuk mengkomunikasikan terkait tarif PPN yang 12 persen ini,” ungkap Suryo dalam konferensi pers di Jakarta, Senin (25/3).</p>\n<div class=\"wsw__embed\"> \n <figure class=\"media-image js-media-expand\"> \n  <div class=\"img-wrap\"> \n   <div class=\"thumb\"> \n    <img alt=\"FILE - Seorang pegawai di kantor pelayanan pajak di Jakarta, 23 Februari 2017. (Foto: Fatima Elkarim/Reuters)\" src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/0BB8B467-145E-43D6-ABAC-767094CC9C3E_w250_r0_s.jpg\"> \n   </div> <span class=\"ico ico-fullscreen ico--media-expand ico--rounded\"></span> \n  </div> \n  <figcaption> <span class=\"caption\">FILE - Seorang pegawai di kantor pelayanan pajak di Jakarta, 23 Februari 2017. (Foto: Fatima Elkarim/Reuters)</span> \n  </figcaption> \n </figure> \n</div> \n<p>Selain itu, menurutnya, pemerintah juga akan mempertimbangkan kondisi perekonomian yang ada sebelum aturan tersebut benar-benar diterapkan.<br> <br> “Jadi di sisi lain kami pun terus melihat dan mengkaji kondisi ekonomi yang ada di sekeliling yakni kegiatan ekonomi yang berpengaruh terhadap peningkatan PPN ini ke depan. Jadi betul-betul kami masih menunggu perkembangannya akan seperti apa,” paparnya.</p> \n<p><strong>Pengusaha Minta Pemerintah Evaluasi Rencana Kenaikan Tarif PPN</strong></p> \n<p>Ketua Umum Asosiasi Pengusaha Indonesia (Apindo) Shinta Widjaja Kamdani meminta pemerintah, terutama pemerintahan mendatang, untuk kembali mempertimbangkan rencana kenaikan tarif PPN tersebut. Pertimbangan ini, katanya, sangat diperlukan mengingat ekonomi global saat ini sedang melemah.<br> <br> “Jadi kami mendengar masukan dari pelaku usaha, tentu saja ini yang harus menjadi perhatian pada saatnya nanti kalau sudah masuk ke pemerintah baru, mereka bisa mengevaluasi kembali melihat kondisi yang ada saat ini karena jelas ini sesuatu yang tidak kita antisipasi bahwa kondisi global akan separah ini, dan pastinya akan berpengaruh,” ungkap Shinta.<br> <br> Menurutnya, apabila ini jadi diterapkan maka akan berpengaruh cukup signifikan terhadap daya beli masyarakat, terutama mereka yang tidak menerima bantuan dari pemerintah.<br> <br> “Yang harus jadi perhatian adalah ke daya beli, jelas dengan kondisi seperti ini, dengan kenaikan menjadi 12 persen itu sebenarnya kalau dari dunia usaha, PPN itu diinikan (dibebankan, red) ke konsumen. Jadi yang akan kena ke konsumennya. Jadi itu yang harus menjadi perhatian pemerintah untuk daya beli daripada konsumen sendiri akan seperti apa. Mereka akan membutuhkan insentif dan lain-lain untuk bisa meningkatkan daya belinya karena pasti akan berpengaruh ke sana,” jelasnya.</p>\n<div class=\"wsw__embed\"> \n <figure class=\"media-image js-media-expand\"> \n  <div class=\"img-wrap\"> \n   <div class=\"thumb\"> \n    <img alt=\"Seorang perempuan memasuki kantor pajak di Jakarta, 23 Februari 2017. (REUTERS/Fatima Elkarim)\" src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-503c-08dc4f29a44d_w250_r0_s.jpg\"> \n   </div> <span class=\"ico ico-fullscreen ico--media-expand ico--rounded\"></span> \n  </div> \n  <figcaption> <span class=\"caption\">Seorang perempuan memasuki kantor pajak di Jakarta, 23 Februari 2017. (REUTERS/Fatima Elkarim)</span> \n  </figcaption> \n </figure> \n</div> \n<p>Sementara itu, ekonom Center of Reform on Economics (CORE) Indonesia Muhammad Faisal mengatakan kalangan masyarakat menengah ke bawah akan cukup terpukul apabila kebijakan tersebut benar-benar diterapkan.<br> <br> Faisal mengungkapkan, pendapatan sebagian kalangan masyarakat tersebut di bawah UMR (umpah minimum regional), dan tidak mendapatkan bantuan apapun dari pemerintah. Ia menyarankan pemerintah agar kebijakan ini tidak mulai diterapkan pada Januari tahun depan.<br> <br> “Ini perlu diberikan ruang dulu terutama kalangan menengah ke bawah yang dia selama ini tidak mendapatkan insentif atau bantuan apapun dari pemerintah. Jadi biarkan dulu mereka dari sisi kemampuan ekonominya membaik, normal, baru kemudian dinaikkan PPN nya sih ok. Jadi jangan mereka belum kembali kondisinya, masih ada efek pandemi, lalu ditekan karena inflasi kemudian harus ditekan karena kenaikan pajak,” ungkap Faisal.<br> <br> Faisal menduga kenaikan tarif PPN menjadi 12 persen ini karena pemerintah melihat pertumbuhan ekonomi dan konsumsi rumah tangga pada tahun lalu yang masih dalam relatif baik yakni lima persen. Padahal menurutnya jika dilihat lebih mendalam, peningkatan pertumbuhan konsumsi masyarakat terutama di kalangan menengah kebawah ini justru melambat.</p>\n<div data-owner-ct=\"Article\" data-inline=\"False\"> \n <div class=\"media-block also-read\"> <a class=\"img-wrap img-wrap--size-3 also-read__img\" href=\"/a/wajib-lapor-barang-bawaan-ke-luar-negeri-tuai-kontroversi/7543154.html\" title=\"Wajib Lapor Barang Bawaan ke Luar Negeri Tuai Kontroversi\"> <span class=\"thumb thumb16_9\"> \n    <noscript class=\"nojs-img\"> \n     <img src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-a076-08dc4db9a724_cx0_cy9_cw0_w100_r1.jpg\" alt=\"ILUSTRASI - Kim Ji-eun, seorang wisatawan, memeriksa isi kopernya di bandara internasional Incheon, Korea Selatan, 25 November 2021. (REUTERS/ Heo Ran)\"> \n    </noscript> <img data-src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-a076-08dc4db9a724_cx0_cy9_cw0_w100_r1.jpg\" alt=\"ILUSTRASI - Kim Ji-eun, seorang wisatawan, memeriksa isi kopernya di bandara internasional Incheon, Korea Selatan, 25 November 2021. (REUTERS/ Heo Ran)\"> </span> </a> \n  <div class=\"media-block__content also-read__body also-read__body--h\"> <a href=\"/a/wajib-lapor-barang-bawaan-ke-luar-negeri-tuai-kontroversi/7543154.html\" title=\"Wajib Lapor Barang Bawaan ke Luar Negeri Tuai Kontroversi\"> <span class=\"also-read__text--label\"> BACA JUGA: </span> <h4 class=\"media-block__title media-block__title--size-3 also-read__text p-0\"> Wajib Lapor Barang Bawaan ke Luar Negeri Tuai Kontroversi </h4> </a> \n  </div> \n </div> \n</div> \n<p>Ia mencontohkan dari sisi jumlah tabungan atau dana pihak ketiga di perbankan yang berjumlah Rp100 juta-Rp500 juta mengalami perlambatan yang sangat signifikan dibandingkan dengan simpanan masyarakat kalangan menengah ke atas.<br> <br> Selain itu banyak upah riil diberbagai sektor mengalami penurunan atau kontraksi kecuali sektor pertanian dan manufaktur yang upahnya masih positif meskipun cukup tipis. Ia menyimpulkan, kemampuan daya beli masih belum pulih atau membaik.<br> <br> “Jadi artinya kalau upah riil-nya itu turun berarti daya beli turun, karena kemampuan membeli kurang. Jadi, dalam kondisi yang sudah ada saja, ditambah dengan inflasi pangan melonjak, ini artinya kalangan menengah ke bawah semakin terbatas <em>disposable income</em>-nya. Beda dengan kalangan menengah atas yang masih relatif kuat. Dan itu sebabnya secara makro tingkat konsumsinya masih bagus karena ditopang oleh kalangan menengah atas yang masih kuat dalam berbelanja,” pungkasnya. <em>[gi/ab]</em></p>', 'Pemerintah mengatakan, rencana kenaikan tarif pajak pertambahan nilai (PPN) menjadi 12 persen mulai 1 Januari 2025 masih akan dikaji.', 44626, 0, '2024-03-28 09:25:07', '2024-03-28 10:00:36', 7);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26983, 'Stock market today: Stocks steady as booming first-quarter comes to close', '<p>Stocks were steady on Thursday morning as markets were set to close a fruitful first quarter of 2024.</p>\n<p>The S&amp;P 500 (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC?p=%5EGSPC&amp;.tsrc=fin-srch\" data-ylk=\"slk:^GSPC;cpos:1;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">^GSPC</a>), the blue-chip Dow Jones Industrial Average (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EDJI?p=%5EDJI&amp;.tsrc=fin-srch\" data-ylk=\"slk:^DJI;cpos:2;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">^DJI</a>), and the tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EIXIC\" data-ylk=\"slk:^IXIC;cpos:3;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">^IXIC</a>) all opened around the flatline. The benchmark S&amp;P <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/stock-market-today-sp-500-hits-fresh-record-dow-jumps-over-475-points-200500649.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:set its latest record close of the year on Wednesday;cpos:4;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;outcm:mb_qualified_link;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;\" class=\"link  yahoo-link\">set its latest record close of the year on Wednesday</a>, while the Dow surged nearly 500 points.</p>\n<p>With markets closed for the Good Friday holiday, Thursday will mark the final trading session of the quarter. It\'s been a banner one for Wall Street: Both the S&amp;P and Nasdaq are up around 10% so far this year.</p>\n<p>What largely started as a megacap-driven rally has <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/energy-stocks-lead-march-gains-in-sign-of-broadening-market-rally-100041049.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:shown signs of broadening;cpos:5;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;outcm:mb_qualified_link;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;\" class=\"link  yahoo-link\">shown signs of broadening</a>. Wall Street firms almost can\'t keep pace with the S&amp;P\'s surge and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/wall-street-just-gave-its-highest-year-end-forecast-yet-for-the-sp-500-133821680.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:have continued to move up their year-end price targets;cpos:6;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;outcm:mb_qualified_link;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;\" class=\"link  yahoo-link\">have continued to move up their year-end price targets</a>. And history <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/the-sp-500-is-up-5-months-straight--and-history-favors-momentum-100025041.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:suggests the momentum could continue;cpos:7;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;outcm:mb_qualified_link;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;\" class=\"link  yahoo-link\">suggests the momentum could continue</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"caas-da \">\n <div data-wf-benji-page-context=\"{&quot;pageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/stock-market-today-stocks-steady-as-booming-first-quarter-comes-to-close-133107077.html&quot;,&quot;spaceid&quot;:&quot;1187300073&quot;,&quot;site&quot;:&quot;finance&quot;,&quot;hashtag&quot;:&quot;news;yfliveblog;investments;stocks;finance&quot;,&quot;lmsid&quot;:&quot;a077000000BAh3wAAD&quot;,&quot;pct&quot;:&quot;story&quot;}\" data-wf-benji-wafer-config=\"{}\" data-wf-benji-config=\"{&quot;positions&quot;:{&quot;INARTICLE-66e0ed9f-0fa9-4123-9834-8229aeeca52e1711634447910&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;INARTICLE-66e0ed9f-0fa9-4123-9834-8229aeeca52e1711634447910&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/22888152279/${REGION}/yfin/ros/dt/${REGION}_yfin_ros_dt_mid_center&quot;,&quot;region&quot;:&quot;index&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;fluid&quot;,&quot;kvs&quot;:{&quot;loc&quot;:&quot;mid_center&quot;},&quot;disableRefresh&quot;:true}}}\" id=\"sda-INARTICLE-66e0ed9f-0fa9-4123-9834-8229aeeca52e1711634447910\" class=\"wafer-benji caas-sda-benji-ad\" data-wf-trigger=\"onLoad\" data-wf-margin=\"100 0\">\n  <div id=\"sdaAdvText-INARTICLE-66e0ed9f-0fa9-4123-9834-8229aeeca52e1711634447910\" class=\"caas-sda-adv-text\">\n   ADVERTISEMENT\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"INARTICLE-66e0ed9f-0fa9-4123-9834-8229aeeca52e1711634447910\"></div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<p>A final reading on fourth-quarter GDP released on Thursday morning showed the US economy grew at a rate of 3.4% versus a prior estimate of 3.2%. On the employment front, initial jobless claims for last week came in at 210,000, versus estimates for 212,000.</p>\n<p>Though Wall Street is closed Friday, investors will be watching for the main data event of the week: the Personal Consumption Expenditures (PCE) price index, which contains the Federal Reserve\'s preferred \"core\" PCE inflation measure.</p>\n<div class=\"caas-stock-chart\">\n <div class=\"wafer-fetch\" data-wf-credentials=\"include\" data-wf-replace=\"1\" data-wf-session-retry-count=\"2\" data-wf-timeout=\"5000\" data-wf-trigger=\"viewport\" data-wf-trigger-offset=\"600 0\" data-wf-body=\"{&quot;m_id&quot;:&quot;quoteSummaryPreview&quot;,&quot;ctrl&quot;:&quot;QuoteSummaryPreview&quot;,&quot;m_mode&quot;:&quot;json&quot;,&quot;config&quot;:{&quot;className&quot;:&quot;ticker-chart&quot;,&quot;comparisons&quot;:&quot;^DJI,^IXIC&quot;,&quot;defaultDateRange&quot;:&quot;ytd&quot;,&quot;exchange&quot;:&quot;SNP&quot;,&quot;isSmartphone&quot;:false,&quot;requestId&quot;:&quot;3d586etj0atl1&quot;,&quot;showAddToWatchlist&quot;:true,&quot;showChartToolBar&quot;:true,&quot;showFullScreenLink&quot;:true,&quot;showTitle&quot;:true,&quot;site&quot;:&quot;finance&quot;,&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;^GSPC&quot;,&quot;theme&quot;:&quot;light&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;enhanced&quot;,&quot;isGradient&quot;:false,&quot;enableQuoteCrumb&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}}\" data-wf-url=\"/fin_ms/_rcv/remote?m_id=quoteSummaryPreview&amp;ctrl=QuoteSummaryPreview&amp;site=finance&amp;rid=3d586etj0atl1&amp;m_mode=json\">\n  <div class=\"caas-card-loader\"></div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"caas-liveblog\" data-id=\"4a8488dc-3f39-499d-99c7-88ec2c96123c\" data-count=\"20\" data-polling-enabled=\"1\" data-maxfailureallowed=\"3\" data-postid-first=\"7ebb35d8-1c96-4e78-a681-a6cd36d69614\" data-postid-last=\"071c8f3f-b6f3-42b1-8580-75df8469e40c\" data-pagination-first-uuid=\"7ebb35d8-1c96-4e78-a681-a6cd36d69614\" data-pagination-last-uuid=\"071c8f3f-b6f3-42b1-8580-75df8469e40c\" data-refresh-delay=\"60000\" data-share-post-enabled=\"0\" data-share-url=\"https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/stock-market-today-stocks-steady-as-booming-first-quarter-comes-to-close-133107077.html\" data-fetchby=\"older\" data-imagelightboxminimumwidth=\"700\" data-site=\"finance\" data-appid=\"article2_web\" data-region=\"SG\" data-article-uuid=\"66e0ed9f-0fa9-4123-9834-8229aeeca52e\">\n <div class=\"header\"></div>\n <div class=\"caas-live-blog-section-badge-wrapper\">\n  <span class=\"caas-live-blog-section-badge isLive\" data-islive=\"1\">Live</span><span class=\"caas-live-blog-section-badge-count\">3 updates</span>\n </div>\n <ul class=\"caas-liveblog-list\">\n  <li class=\"caas-liveblogpost\" data-id=\"7ebb35d8-1c96-4e78-a681-a6cd36d69614\" id=\"7ebb35d8-1c96-4e78-a681-a6cd36d69614\" data-lmt=\"{&quot;utc&quot;:&quot;Thu, 28 Mar 2024 13:34:29 GMT&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;2024-03-28T13:34:29.000Z&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;Thu, 28 March 2024 at 10:34 pm GMT+9&quot;,&quot;timestamp&quot;:1711632869000}\">\n   <div class=\"liveblogposts-post\">\n    <div class=\"post\">\n     <div class=\"timeline-point  with-author-name\">\n      <img class=\"avatar\" src=\"https://o.aolcdn.com/images/dims?image_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fs.yimg.com%2Fos%2Fcreatr-uploaded-images%2F2019-06%2F97285f00-895d-11e9-9b7a-2b53cff69736&amp;compress=1&amp;progressive=1&amp;quality=75&amp;client=hawkeye&amp;signature=9c0d71acf684c03ee294d31b319e6ee0f5427b68\">\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"timestamp-byline\">\n      <time class=\"timestamp-most-recent liveblogpost-relative-time\" data-timestamp=\"1711632817000\">Thu, 28 March 2024 at 10:33 pm GMT+9</time>\n      <div class=\"byline-meta\">\n       <div class=\"byline\">\n        Ines Ferré\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content-wrapper  with-author-name\">\n     <div class=\"content-body\">\n      <div class=\"content-block  with-author-name\">\n       <h2 class=\"headline\">Stocks steady on last trading day of month and quarter</h2>\n       <div class=\"body\">\n        <p>Stocks held steady at the open on Thursday morning as markets were set to round out their best quarter first quarter in five years.</p>\n        <p>The S&amp;P 500 (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC?p=%5EGSPC&amp;.tsrc=fin-srch\" data-ylk=\"slk:^GSPC;cpos:1;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">^GSPC</a>), the blue-chip Dow Jones Industrial Average (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EDJI?p=%5EDJI&amp;.tsrc=fin-srch\" data-ylk=\"slk:^DJI;cpos:2;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">^DJI</a>), and the tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EIXIC\" data-ylk=\"slk:^IXIC;cpos:3;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">^IXIC</a>) all hovered around the flatline at the start of the last trading session of the month. With markets closed for the Good Friday holiday, Thursday will mark the final trading session of the quarter too.</p>\n        <p>The S&amp;P and Nasdaq are up roughly 10% since the start of 2024.</p>\n        <p>A final reading on fourth-quarter GDP released on Thursday morning showed the economy grew at a rate of 3.4% versus a prior estimate of 3.2%. On the employment front, initial jobless claims for last week came in at 210,000, versus estimates for 212,000.</p>\n        <div class=\"caas-stock-chart\">\n         <div class=\"wafer-fetch\" data-wf-credentials=\"include\" data-wf-replace=\"1\" data-wf-session-retry-count=\"2\" data-wf-timeout=\"5000\" data-wf-trigger=\"viewport\" data-wf-trigger-offset=\"600 0\" data-wf-body=\"{&quot;m_id&quot;:&quot;quoteSummaryPreview&quot;,&quot;ctrl&quot;:&quot;QuoteSummaryPreview&quot;,&quot;m_mode&quot;:&quot;json&quot;,&quot;config&quot;:{&quot;className&quot;:&quot;ticker-chart&quot;,&quot;comparisons&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;defaultDateRange&quot;:&quot;ytd&quot;,&quot;exchange&quot;:&quot;SNP&quot;,&quot;isSmartphone&quot;:false,&quot;requestId&quot;:&quot;3d586etj0atl1&quot;,&quot;showAddToWatchlist&quot;:true,&quot;showChartToolBar&quot;:true,&quot;showFullScreenLink&quot;:true,&quot;showTitle&quot;:true,&quot;site&quot;:&quot;finance&quot;,&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;^GSPC&quot;,&quot;theme&quot;:&quot;light&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;enhanced&quot;,&quot;isGradient&quot;:false,&quot;enableQuoteCrumb&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}}\" data-wf-url=\"/fin_ms/_rcv/remote?m_id=quoteSummaryPreview&amp;ctrl=QuoteSummaryPreview&amp;site=finance&amp;rid=3d586etj0atl1&amp;m_mode=json\">\n          <div class=\"caas-card-loader\"></div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div></li>\n  <li class=\"caas-liveblogpost\" data-id=\"391d7d94-95df-414f-985f-78341a9ce810\" id=\"391d7d94-95df-414f-985f-78341a9ce810\" data-lmt=\"{&quot;utc&quot;:&quot;Thu, 28 Mar 2024 13:14:10 GMT&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;2024-03-28T13:14:10.000Z&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;Thu, 28 March 2024 at 10:14 pm GMT+9&quot;,&quot;timestamp&quot;:1711631650000}\">\n   <div class=\"liveblogposts-post\">\n    <div class=\"post\">\n     <div class=\"timeline-point  with-author-name\">\n      <img class=\"avatar\" src=\"https://o.aolcdn.com/images/dims?image_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fs.yimg.com%2Fos%2Fcreatr-uploaded-images%2F2019-06%2F97285f00-895d-11e9-9b7a-2b53cff69736&amp;compress=1&amp;progressive=1&amp;quality=75&amp;client=hawkeye&amp;signature=9c0d71acf684c03ee294d31b319e6ee0f5427b68\">\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"timestamp-byline\">\n      <time class=\"timestamp-most-recent liveblogpost-relative-time\" data-timestamp=\"1711631609000\">Thu, 28 March 2024 at 10:13 pm GMT+9</time>\n      <div class=\"byline-meta\">\n       <div class=\"byline\">\n        Ines Ferré\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content-wrapper  with-author-name\">\n     <div class=\"content-body\">\n      <div class=\"content-block  with-author-name\">\n       <h2 class=\"headline\">Energy sector outperforms in March in signs of broadening rally</h2>\n       <div class=\"body\">\n        <p>March has been a solid month for the S&amp;P 500 (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC\" data-ylk=\"slk:^GSPC;cpos:1;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">^GSPC</a>) — and an even better one for oil- and gas-related stocks.</p>\n        <p>As the month draws to a close, energy has emerged as the top-performing sector. The S&amp;P 500 Energy Select ETF (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/XLE/\" data-ylk=\"slk:XLE;cpos:2;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">XLE</a>), which includes oil giants like ExxonMobil (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/XOM\" data-ylk=\"slk:XOM;cpos:3;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">XOM</a>), Chevron (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CVX\" data-ylk=\"slk:CVX;cpos:4;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">CVX</a>), and ConocoPhillips (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/COP?.tsrc=fin-srch\" data-ylk=\"slk:COP;cpos:5;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">COP</a>), has gained more than 9% compared to the benchmark index\'s rise of nearly 3% in the same period.</p>\n        <p>Read <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/energy-stocks-lead-march-gains-in-sign-of-broadening-market-rally-100041049.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:more here:;cpos:6;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;outcm:mb_qualified_link;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;\" class=\"link  yahoo-link\">more here: </a></p>\n        <div class=\"caas-iframe-wrapper\">\n         <div class=\"caas-iframe flourish\" style=\"padding-bottom:56%\" data-type=\"flourish\">\n          <blockquote data-src=\"https://flo.uri.sh/visualisation/17324755/embed?auto=1\">\n           <div class=\"caas-card-loader\"></div>\n           <noscript>\n            <iframe src=\"https://flo.uri.sh/visualisation/17324755/embed?auto=1\"></iframe>\n           </noscript>\n          </blockquote>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div></li>\n  <li class=\"caas-liveblogpost\" data-id=\"071c8f3f-b6f3-42b1-8580-75df8469e40c\" id=\"071c8f3f-b6f3-42b1-8580-75df8469e40c\" data-lmt=\"{&quot;utc&quot;:&quot;Thu, 28 Mar 2024 11:49:01 GMT&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;2024-03-28T11:49:01.000Z&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;Thu, 28 March 2024 at 8:49 pm GMT+9&quot;,&quot;timestamp&quot;:1711626541000}\">\n   <div class=\"liveblogposts-post\">\n    <div class=\"post\">\n     <div class=\"timeline-point  with-author-name\">\n      <img class=\"avatar\" src=\"https://o.aolcdn.com/images/dims?image_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fo.aolcdn.com%2Fimages%2Fdims%3Fimage_uri%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fo.aolcdn.com%252Fimages%252Fdims%253Fimage_uri%253Dhttps%25253A%25252F%25252Fs.yimg.com%25252Fos%25252Fcreatr-uploaded-images%25252F2018-11%25252F567ff670-e430-11e8-bc9d-fa492b316fd5%2526compress%253D1%2526progressive%253D1%2526quality%253D75%2526client%253Dhawkeye%2526signature%253Dedde5d24ee579df632df6694e3b642b6d5beb840%26compress%3D1%26progressive%3D1%26quality%3D75%26client%3Dhawkeye%26signature%3Dc386cd0d6ebb758b914a2de673362c0f009c7c92&amp;compress=1&amp;progressive=1&amp;quality=75&amp;client=hawkeye&amp;signature=594cb8c26226a887d845f748734cc43551c4822e\">\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"timestamp-byline\">\n      <time class=\"timestamp-most-recent liveblogpost-relative-time\" data-timestamp=\"1711626541000\">Thu, 28 March 2024 at 8:49 pm GMT+9</time>\n      <div class=\"byline-meta\">\n       <div class=\"byline\">\n        Brian Sozzi\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content-wrapper  with-author-name\">\n     <div class=\"content-body\">\n      <div class=\"content-block  with-author-name\">\n       <h2 class=\"headline\">Behind the scenes with General Motors CEO Mary Barra</h2>\n       <div class=\"body\">\n        <p>Yahoo Finance just dropped its latest <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/live/lead-this-way/\" data-ylk=\"slk:Lead This Way;cpos:1;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">Lead This Way</a> episode, this with General Motors (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GM?.tsrc=fin-srch\" data-ylk=\"slk:GM;cpos:2;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">GM</a>) long-time chair and CEO Mary Barra. Full watch <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/gm-will-be-executing-on-its-ev-ambitions-in-2024-says-ceo-mary-barra-100003002.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:here;cpos:3;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;outcm:mb_qualified_link;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;\" class=\"link  yahoo-link\">here</a>.</p>\n        <p>It was really a great treat for me to spend a day with Barra touring an EV manufacturing facility in Detroit. The complexity of making electric vehicles at scale is something I don’t think most auto investors appreciate (which explains why Fisker is probably going out of business and Lucid just needed a capital infusion) – I know I didn’t fully grasp it.</p>\n        <p>A couple of takeaways from my time with Mary:</p>\n        <ul class=\"caas-list caas-list-bullet\">\n         <li><p>It’s not easy for a legacy automaker to suddenly make lots of electric cars! In part, this is why the Big 3 has been under-earning during the EV transition the past few years.</p></li>\n         <li><p>It’s worthwhile to spend some time on Yahoo Finance and study the valuation on GM. You can do that <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GM/key-statistics\" data-ylk=\"slk:here;cpos:4;pos:1;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">here</a>. A basic numbers crunch suggests the stock is simply too cheap, provided more EV curveballs aren’t thrown the way of the auto industry.</p></li>\n         <li><p>Mary Barra remains the right leader for this pivotal time for GM. I don’t envision her leaving anytime soon, and that’s a good thing.</p></li>\n        </ul>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div></li>\n </ul>\n</div>', NULL, 76060, 0, '2024-03-28 09:34:29', '2024-03-28 10:00:48', 10);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26984, 'Cybersecurity platform Coro raises $100 mln at valuation of $750 mln', '<p>JERUSALEM, March 28 (Reuters) - Coro, a U.S.-Israeli cybersecurity platform for small and medium-sized businesses (SMEs), has raised $100 million in a private funding round at a company valuation of $750 million, it said on Thursday.</p>\n<p>The series D round was led by One Peak, with participation from existing investors Energy Impact Partners and Balderton Capital, it said, bringing total funds raised to $255 million in the past 24 months.</p>\n<p>The new funds will be used to boost product innovation and accelerate global expansion, Coro said.</p>\n<p>Coro is an all-in-one cybersecurity system that offers an enterprise-grade security software platform to SMEs, covering endpoint protection as well as email and user protection plus network and cloud protection.</p>\n<div class=\"caas-da \">\n <div data-wf-benji-page-context=\"{&quot;pageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/cybersecurity-platform-coro-raises-100-132041044.html&quot;,&quot;spaceid&quot;:&quot;1187300073&quot;,&quot;site&quot;:&quot;finance&quot;,&quot;hashtag&quot;:&quot;investments;finance;venturecapital&quot;,&quot;lmsid&quot;:&quot;a0770000002GZ5iAAG&quot;,&quot;pct&quot;:&quot;story&quot;}\" data-wf-benji-wafer-config=\"{}\" data-wf-benji-config=\"{&quot;positions&quot;:{&quot;INARTICLE-e7b15739-de96-37f1-9f32-f5ba817b7e701711634448527&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;INARTICLE-e7b15739-de96-37f1-9f32-f5ba817b7e701711634448527&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/22888152279/${REGION}/yfin/ros/dt/${REGION}_yfin_ros_dt_mid_center&quot;,&quot;region&quot;:&quot;index&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;fluid&quot;,&quot;kvs&quot;:{&quot;loc&quot;:&quot;mid_center&quot;},&quot;disableRefresh&quot;:true}}}\" id=\"sda-INARTICLE-e7b15739-de96-37f1-9f32-f5ba817b7e701711634448527\" class=\"wafer-benji caas-sda-benji-ad\" data-wf-trigger=\"onLoad\" data-wf-margin=\"100 0\">\n  <div id=\"sdaAdvText-INARTICLE-e7b15739-de96-37f1-9f32-f5ba817b7e701711634448527\" class=\"caas-sda-adv-text\">\n   ADVERTISEMENT\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"INARTICLE-e7b15739-de96-37f1-9f32-f5ba817b7e701711634448527\"></div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<p>SMEs, the company said, are facing increasing volumes and complexity of cyberattacks and lack affordable solutions to help them to protect themselves adequately.</p>\n<p>\"We aim to turn Coro into a multibillion-dollar company, as we’ve done multiple times before,” said Yoav Tzruya, general partner at Jerusalem Venture Partners and a Coro board member.</p>\n<p>(Reporting by Steven Scheer Editing by David Goodman)</p>', NULL, 38934, 0, '2024-03-28 09:20:41', '2024-03-28 10:00:49', 10);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26985, 'Estados Unidos atribuem a Júlia Wachave Prémio Mulher de Coragem 2024', '<p>Como líder da Associação para a Protecção das Mulheres e Meninas, “Júlia Wachave esteve na vanguarda da prestação de assistência às mulheres deslocadas internamente nos distritos do norte de Cabo Delgado”, lê-se num comunicado da embaixada amaericana.</p> \n<p>Cabo Delgado é alvo de uma insurgência movida por um grupo associado ao Estado Islâmico, desde 2017, que deslocou cerca de um milhão de pessoas e matou milhares.</p> \n<p>No ato de entrega do prémio, o embaixador dos Estados Unidos Peter Vrooman destacou o trabalho de Júlia Wachave, afirmando que \"corajosamente, ela superou sérias ameaças à sua vida (...) promovendo e protegendo os direitos humanos das centenas de milhares de mulheres e raparigas de Cabo Delgado”.</p> \n<p>Para Vrooman, a dedicação de Júlia Wachave “ajudou a criar um futuro mais seguro e esperançoso para algumas das populações mais vulneráveis do mundo.\"</p> \n<p>“Antes de mais, partilhar este prémio com a minha mãe, aqui presente. Estou a trabalhar em Cabo Delgado há mais de 14 anos, e durante estes anos temos acompanhado realidades duras”, Wachave ao aceitar a distinção.</p> \n<p>Ela, que há mais de 20 anos é defensora dos direitos humanos, disse que “toda mulher que vem ao mundo vem para realizar os seus sonhos com os seus direitos. Então não podemos tirar o sonho de uma mulher!”</p>', 'A moçambicana Júlia Wachave recebeu esta quinta-feira, 28 março, o Prémio Mulher de Coragem da Embaixada dos E.U.A. de 2024, pelo trabalho que tem vindo a desenvolver para proteger e advogar pelos direitos das mulheres e das raparigas em Cabo Delgado.', 63023, 0, '2024-03-28 09:08:28', '2024-03-28 10:00:59', 13);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26986, '拜登政府宣布首个联邦政府AI应用新规--不得侵犯民众的权利和安全', '<span class=\"dateline\">白宫 —&nbsp;</span> \n<p>拜登-哈里斯政府在2024年3月28号宣布了针对美国联邦政府机构使用人工智能（AI）的最新规定，以促进联邦政府安全、可靠和负责任地使用人工智能。新规第一条，联邦政府在使用人工智能工具时不得侵犯民众的权利和安全。拜登政府同时希望，新的人工智能使用规范可以成为其他国家效仿的榜样。</p> \n<p><strong>AI的使用不得伤害民众的权利和安全</strong></p> \n<p>新规也是乔·拜登（Joe Biden）2023年10月30日签署的“关于安全、可靠和可信地开发和使用AI人工智能的行政命令”的核心部分。</p> \n<p>在白宫3月27号召开新闻简报会上，副总统卡马拉·哈里斯(Kamala Harris)宣布了三项新的并具有约束力的政策要求。哈里斯去年11月代表美国参加了在伦敦举行的首届“全球人工智能峰会”。</p> \n<p>哈里斯说，第一条是制定新标准来保护美国民众的权利和安全。她说：“当联邦政府机构使用人工智能工具时，我们现在要求各机构必须能验证这些工具不会危及美国民众的权利和安全。”</p> \n<p>哈里斯举例，如果退伍军人管理局想要在退伍军人管理局医院使用人工智能来帮助医生诊断患者，他们首先必须证明人工智能不会产生种族偏见的诊断。</p> \n<p>白宫提供的事实说明当中说，该政策兼顾个人隐私权。比如在机场时，如果旅客可以选择不使用美国运输安全管理局的面部识别系统，要确保他们不会因此造成任何延误或需要重新排队。由于人工智能的使用而权益受到侵害的人，也将有机会寻求补救措施。</p> \n<p><strong>AI的使用需透明与问责</strong></p> \n<p>哈里斯说，第二项要求是透明度与问责。她说：“美国人民有权知道他们的政府何时，及如何使用人工智能，并且是以负责任的方式使用人工智能。”</p> \n<p>为了保障人工智能使用的透明，拜登政府将要求美国政府机构每年在网上发布一份人工智能系统清单，并评估这些系统可能带来的风险，以及如何管理这些风险。</p> \n<p>白宫的事实说明更强调，在不会对公众或政府运营构成风险的前提下，将公布政府拥有的人工智能程式码、模型和数据，以示透明与负责。</p> \n<p><strong>设立首席人工智能官，内部监督，管控风险</strong></p> \n<p>根据副总统哈里斯，第三条是，白宫将指示所有联邦机构设立首席人工智能官，专门负责监督该机构所有人工智能技术的使用。这名官员必须拥有丰富的经验、专业知识和权力来进行监督。简报会上一位高阶官员表示，这些人工智能官员，有些将是政治任命。</p> \n<p>白宫高级官员补充说，各联邦机构还将被要求设立“人工智能管理委员会”，由各机构的副部长或同等级别人员担任主席，协调和管理整个机构人工智能的使用。目前，美国国防部、退伍军人事务部、住房和城市发展部及国务院都已建立这个委员会，其他联邦机构需在5月27日之前成立。</p> \n<p>此文各联邦机构必须延请第三方独立人工智能专家进行评估。另一位高阶官员在简报会上表示，所有与人工智能相关资讯，都将公布在ai.gov网站，以及各机构自己的网站上。</p> \n<p><strong>首个关注联邦机构AI应用的政策</strong></p> \n<p>白宫管理和预算办公室主任莎兰达·杨（Shalanda Yang）在简报会上说，这是有史以来第一个重点关注管理联邦机构对人工智能使用的政策。</p> \n<p>她说，今后联邦机构将被要求，在可能影响公众权利或安全的方面使用人工智能时，必须采取具体的保障措施。 此外，联邦机构还要独立评估人工智能的用途，监控它们是否存在错误和失败，并防范歧视风险。拜登总统的行政命令要求白宫管理和预算办公室以180天进行研究并出台政策。</p> \n<p>简报会上一位高级官员解释，新规定不仅限于政府机构本身，与联邦政府订合同的承包商也须遵守。</p> \n<p>为了能够大幅度的将人工智能与联邦政府机构结合，拜登政府预计今年夏天将聘雇100名AI专家进入“全国人工智能人才潮”（National AI Talent Surge），来促进可信赖以及安全的人工智能使用。并将在4月18号举办征人展。</p> \n<p>拜登政府2025财政年度预算当中，编列了额外的500万美元，来扩大联邦政府的人工智能培训计划；该计划去年有来自78个联邦机构的4,800多人参与。</p> \n<p><strong>希望其他国家效仿</strong></p> \n<p>哈里斯副总统强调，拜登政府的用意，是为负责且安全的人工智能运用，建立普世的规则与规范提供标准，并呼吁所有国家效仿美国的作法。</p> \n<p>她说：“我们将继续呼吁所有国家在政府使用人工智能方面效仿我们的做法，将公共利益放在第一位。”</p> \n<p>在白宫公布联邦政府人工智能使用的新规的同时，白宫的科学与技术政策办公室随即公布了“人工智能权利法案”的蓝图 ，提供未来美国国会立法，以及各级政府施政考量。</p>', NULL, 77451, 0, '2024-03-28 05:07:33', '2024-03-28 11:00:01', 1);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26987, '投資人觀望經濟數據交投清淡 美股開盤持平', '<p>（中央社紐約2024年3月28日綜合外電報導）復活節假期即將到來，美國股市主要指數今天在交投清淡的情況下開盤持平，同時投資人正觀望更多經濟數據以衡量美國聯邦準備理事會（Fed）的政策路徑。</p>\n<p>道瓊工業指數開盤小漲3.66點或0.01%，報39763.74點。</p>\n<p>標準普爾500指數開盤小跌0.46點或0.01%，報5248.03點。</p>\n<p>那斯達克指數開盤小挫22.29點或0.14%，報16377.23點。</p>', NULL, 28970, 0, '2024-03-28 10:29:59', '2024-03-28 11:00:12', 3);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (26988, 'Sept mois après le coup d\'Etat au Gabon, un dialogue national diversement apprécié', '<p>Le respect jusqu\'ici du calendrier d\'une transition de deux ans est salué par la communauté internationale et une grande majorité de Gabonais, pour qui le général est un<em> \"héros\"</em> qui les a sauvés d\'un régime <em>\"corrompu\"</em>, mais des voix s\'élèvent pour fustiger un dialogue <em>\"entre soi\"</em>, qui pavera une voie royale au général Oligui vers la présidentielle.</p>\n<div class=\"wsw__embed\"> \n <div class=\"media-pholder media-pholder--video \"> \n  <div class=\"c-sticky-container\" data-poster=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-c0a8-0242-c851-08dc3881a66b_tv_w250_r1.jpg\"> \n   <div class=\"c-sticky-element\" data-sp_api=\"pangea-video\" data-persistent data-persistent-browse-out> \n    <div class=\"c-mmp c-mmp--enabled c-mmp--loading c-mmp--video c-mmp--standard c-mmp--has-poster c-sticky-element__swipe-el\" data-player_id=\"\" data-title=\"Gabon : six mois après le coup d\'État, les Gabonais partagent des sentiments mitigés\" data-hide-title=\"False\" data-breakpoint_s=\"320\" data-breakpoint_m=\"640\" data-breakpoint_l=\"992\" data-hlsjs-src=\"/Scripts/responsive/hls.b\" data-bypass-dash-for-vod=\"true\" data-bypass-dash-for-live-video=\"true\" data-bypass-dash-for-live-audio=\"true\"> \n     <div class=\"c-mmp__poster js-poster c-mmp__poster--video\"> \n      <img src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-c0a8-0242-c851-08dc3881a66b_tv_w250_r1.jpg\" alt=\"Gabon : six mois après le coup d\'État, les Gabonais partagent des sentiments mitigés\" title=\"Gabon : six mois après le coup d\'État, les Gabonais partagent des sentiments mitigés\"> \n     </div> <a class=\"c-mmp__fallback-link\" href=\"https://av.voanews.com/Videoroot/Pangeavideo/2024/02/0/01/01000000-c0a8-0242-c851-08dc3881a66b_240p.mp4\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__fallback-link-icon\"> <span class=\"ico ico-play\"></span> </span> </a> \n     <div class=\"c-spinner\