      <div class=\"c-mmp__cpanel-additional-controls\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__cpanel-additional-controls-volume js-volume-controls\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__cpanel-btn c-mmp__cpanel-btn--volume js-btn-volume\" title=\"volume\"> <span class=\"ico ico-volume-unmuted m-0\"></span> </span> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator c-mmp__indicator--vertical js-volume-panel\" dir=\"ltr\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-lines js-volumebar\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-line c-mmp__indicator-line--range js-volume-range\" style=\"height:100%\"></span> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-line c-mmp__indicator-line--volume js-volume-level\" style=\"height:0%\"></span> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-slider\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__indicator-btn ta-c c-mmp__indicator-btn--hidden js-volumebar-btn\"> <button class=\"c-mmp__indicator-btn-pointer\" type=\"button\"></button> </span> </span> </span> </span> </span> \n        <div class=\"c-mmp__cpanel-additional-controls-settings js-settings-controls\"> <span class=\"c-mmp__cpanel-btn c-mmp__cpanel-btn--settings-overlay js-btn-settings-overlay\" title=\"source switch\"> <span class=\"ico ico-settings m-0\"></span> </span> <span class=\"c-mmp__cpanel-btn c-mmp__cpanel-btn--settings-expand js-btn-settings-expand\" title=\"source switch\"> <span class=\"ico ico-settings m-0\"></span> </span> \n         <div class=\"c-mmp__expander c-mmp__expander--sources js-c-mmp__expander--sources\"> \n          <div class=\"c-mmp__expander-content js-sources\"></div> \n         </div> \n        </div> <a href=\"/embed/player/Article/7548625.html?type=video&amp;FullScreenMode=True\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"c-mmp__cpanel-btn c-mmp__cpanel-btn--fullscreen js-btn-fullscreen\" title=\"fullscreen\"> <span class=\"ico ico-fullscreen m-0\"></span> </a> \n       </div> \n      </div> \n     </div> \n    </div> \n   </div> \n  </div> \n  <div class=\"media-download\"> \n   <div class=\"simple-menu\"> <span class=\"handler\"> <span class=\"ico ico-download\"></span> <span class=\"label\">Faça o Download</span> <span class=\"ico ico-chevron-down\"></span> </span> \n    <div class=\"inner\"> \n     <ul class=\"subitems\"> \n      <li class=\"subitem\"> <a href=\"https://av.voanews.com/Videoroot/Pangeavideo/2024/03/0/01/01000000-0aff-0242-e113-08dc4fee5de0_240p.mp4?download=1\" title=\"240p | 10,3MB\" class=\"handler\" onclick=\"FireAnalyticsTagEventOnDownload(this, \'video\', 7548625, \'Cabo Delgado: Analistas alertam sobre os riscos da saída da SAMIM\', null, \'Morais Selemane\', \'2024\', \'03\', \'29\')\"> 240p | 10,3MB </a> </li> \n      <li class=\"subitem\"> <a href=\"https://av.voanews.com/Videoroot/Pangeavideo/2024/03/0/01/01000000-0aff-0242-e113-08dc4fee5de0.mp4?download=1\" title=\"360p | 17,2MB\" class=\"handler\" onclick=\"FireAnalyticsTagEventOnDownload(this, \'video\', 7548625, \'Cabo Delgado: Analistas alertam sobre os riscos da saída da SAMIM\', null, \'Morais Selemane\', \'2024\', \'03\', \'29\')\"> 360p | 17,2MB </a> </li> \n      <li class=\"subitem\"> <a href=\"https://av.voanews.com/Videoroot/Pangeavideo/2024/03/0/01/01000000-0aff-0242-e113-08dc4fee5de0_480p.mp4?download=1\" title=\"480p | 32,4MB\" class=\"handler\" onclick=\"FireAnalyticsTagEventOnDownload(this, \'video\', 7548625, \'Cabo Delgado: Analistas alertam sobre os riscos da saída da SAMIM\', null, \'Morais Selemane\', \'2024\', \'03\', \'29\')\"> 480p | 32,4MB </a> </li> \n      <li class=\"subitem\"> <a href=\"https://av.voanews.com/Videoroot/Pangeavideo/2024/03/0/01/01000000-0aff-0242-e113-08dc4fee5de0_720p.mp4?download=1\" title=\"720p | 54,4MB\" class=\"handler\" onclick=\"FireAnalyticsTagEventOnDownload(this, \'video\', 7548625, \'Cabo Delgado: Analistas alertam sobre os riscos da saída da SAMIM\', null, \'Morais Selemane\', \'2024\', \'03\', \'29\')\"> 720p | 54,4MB </a> </li> \n      <li class=\"subitem\"> <a href=\"https://av.voanews.com/Videoroot/Pangeavideo/2024/03/0/01/01000000-0aff-0242-e113-08dc4fee5de0_1080p.mp4?download=1\" title=\"1080p | 91,1MB\" class=\"handler\" onclick=\"FireAnalyticsTagEventOnDownload(this, \'video\', 7548625, \'Cabo Delgado: Analistas alertam sobre os riscos da saída da SAMIM\', null, \'Morais Selemane\', \'2024\', \'03\', \'29\')\"> 1080p | 91,1MB </a> </li> \n     </ul> \n    </div> \n   </div> \n  </div> \n </div> \n</div> \n<p>O analista político, Frederico João, diz estar igualmente apreensivo com a possível saída, \"uma vez que a força da SAMIM contribuiu de forma significativa para estancar o avanço das forças terroristas e ajudaram o governo a criar capacidades para combater o terrorismo, não apenas neste momento como também futuramente\".</p> \n<p>Para o analista político, Calton Cadeado, se a SADC se retirar vai ter que partilhar informações, porque caso Moçambique fracasse isso vai afetar também os países da região.</p>\n<div data-owner-ct=\"Article\" data-inline=\"False\"> \n <div class=\"media-block also-read\"> <a class=\"img-wrap img-wrap--size-3 also-read__img\" href=\"/a/cabo-delgado-deslocados-est%C3%A3o-a-viver-de-forma-miser%C3%A1vel/7546087.html\" title=\"Cabo Delgado: Deslocados estão a viver de forma miserável\"> <span class=\"thumb thumb16_9\"> \n    <noscript class=\"nojs-img\"> \n     <img src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-d905-08dc4e910554_w100_r1.jpg\" alt=\"Deslocados em Metuge, Cabo Delgado \"> \n    </noscript> <img data-src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-d905-08dc4e910554_w100_r1.jpg\" alt=\"Deslocados em Metuge, Cabo Delgado \"> </span> </a> \n  <div class=\"media-block__content also-read__body also-read__body--h\"> <a href=\"/a/cabo-delgado-deslocados-est%C3%A3o-a-viver-de-forma-miser%C3%A1vel/7546087.html\" title=\"Cabo Delgado: Deslocados estão a viver de forma miserável\"> <span class=\"also-read__text--label\"> Veja Também </span> <h4 class=\"media-block__title media-block__title--size-3 also-read__text p-0\"> Cabo Delgado: Deslocados estão a viver de forma miserável </h4> </a> \n  </div> \n </div> \n</div> \n<p>João Feijó, também analista político, afirma, por seu turno, que a eventual retirada da força da SAMIM vai ser \"muito má\", porque o Governo moçambicano continua a insistir numa determinada estratégia militar na luta contra a insurgência. Feijó realçou que \"construir um país em que os problemas se resolvem com base na pressão militar, esse país é insustentável, o Governo não tem recursos para criar uma estratégia contra a insurgência\".</p> \n<p>Entretanto, o presidente moçambicano já reagiu e afirmou que o Governo \"está a trabalhar com vários países e organizações multilaterais, no sentido de manter o estado e intensificar a força no terreno, porque o inimigo está a caprichar e nós achamos que temos que estar sempre em cima deles\".</p>\n<div data-owner-ct=\"Article\" data-inline=\"False\"> \n <div class=\"media-block also-read\"> <a class=\"img-wrap img-wrap--size-3 also-read__img\" href=\"/a/cabo-delgado-pr-e-analistas-pol%C3%ADticos-com-leituras-diferentes-sobre-seguran%C3%A7a-na-prov%C3%ADncia/7529601.html\" title=\"Cabo Delgado: PR e analistas políticos com leituras diferentes sobre segurança na província\"> <span class=\"thumb thumb16_9\"> \n    <noscript class=\"nojs-img\"> \n     <img src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0a00-0242-6afe-08dc229a530f_cx19_cy9_cw79_w100_r1.jpg\" alt=\"Presidente de Moçambique, Filipe Nyusi, em campanha eleitoral para as presidenciais em outubro de 2019.\"> \n    </noscript> <img data-src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0a00-0242-6afe-08dc229a530f_cx19_cy9_cw79_w100_r1.jpg\" alt=\"Presidente de Moçambique, Filipe Nyusi, em campanha eleitoral para as presidenciais em outubro de 2019.\"> </span> </a> \n  <div class=\"media-block__content also-read__body also-read__body--h\"> <a href=\"/a/cabo-delgado-pr-e-analistas-pol%C3%ADticos-com-leituras-diferentes-sobre-seguran%C3%A7a-na-prov%C3%ADncia/7529601.html\" title=\"Cabo Delgado: PR e analistas políticos com leituras diferentes sobre segurança na província\"> <span class=\"also-read__text--label\"> Veja Também </span> <h4 class=\"media-block__title media-block__title--size-3 also-read__text p-0\"> Cabo Delgado: PR e analistas políticos com leituras diferentes sobre segurança na província </h4> </a> \n  </div> \n </div> \n</div> \n<p>Desde outubro de 2017, a província de Cabo Delgado tem sido atacada por inusurgentes, que dizem pertencer ao Estado Islâmico. Em resultado cerca de quatro mil pessoas perderam a vida e mais de um milhão de pessoas encontra-se deslocada, além de avultados prejuízos patrimoniais.</p>', 'Presidente Filipe Nyusi diz que seu Governo trabalha com vários parceiros para enfrentar a saída da SAMIM', 54989, 0, '2024-04-01 11:12:34', '2024-04-01 12:01:18', 13);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (27250, '美日韩据信正协调举行第二次首脑会议 继续共同应对中朝威胁', '<p>据信，美国政府正与日本和韩国政府协调在今年7月北约华盛顿峰会期间再次举行美日韩领导人峰会，讨论如何共同应对中国和朝鲜越来越大的安全威胁。<br> <br> 日本和韩国领导人应邀列席北约峰会正在成为常态，展现了北约与印太地区国家之间安全合作正日益加深。<br> <br> 去年8月，美日韩领导人在美国首都华盛顿郊外的戴维营举行了首次峰会，并约定每年举行一次这样的三国首脑会议。<br> <br> 日本媒体星期天（2024年3月31日）引述外交消息人士的话说，美国总统拜登可能会在下星期4月10日与日本首相岸田文雄会面时正式邀请他今年7月再次访美，并参与美日韩三方首脑峰会。<br> <br> 在去年8月的峰会上，三国领导人答应在地区出现危机时三边作出联合回应，并聚焦来自中国和朝鲜的安全威胁。三方的联合声明指出北京“在南中国海支持非法海洋权利声索的危险与咄咄逼人的行为”，并表示“我们强烈反对任何单方面改变印太水域现状的企图。我们尤其坚定反对将填海造地的岛礁军事化；危险地使用海警和海上民兵船只；以及胁迫行动。”<br> <br> 三国领导人还重申致力于维持台湾海峡的和平稳定并应对经济胁迫。<br> <br> 中国当时抨击美国主办美日韩峰会是华盛顿企图把亚太地区变成“地缘政治竞争的角斗场”。<br> <br> 首次的三国首脑会议已经取得了一些具体成果。<br> <br> 根据三国峰会达成的协议，三国建立了国家安全委员会（NSC）热线电话，三国首脑和国安首长可随时通过该系统进行语音和视讯交流。<br> <br> 白宫官员去年12月表示，根据协议，三国将开始共享朝鲜导弹发射预警情报。</p>', NULL, 94312, 0, '2024-04-01 02:38:29', '2024-04-01 13:00:00', 1);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (27251, 'US Steel and Humana Are on the Casualty List', '<p>Not every stock that gets roughed up deserves it.</p>\n<p>Finding stocks that have been banged around, and that have good recovery potential, is the point of my quarterly Casualty List. This year\'s first quarter saw healthy gains for most stocks but some stocks took it on the chin.</p>\n<p>Four that I think are likely to bounce back are United States Steel Corp. (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/X/GF-Score/United+States+Steel+Corp\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:NYSE:X;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">NYSE:X</a>), Humana Inc. (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/HUM/GF-Score/United+States+Steel+Corp\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:NYSE:HUM;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">NYSE:HUM</a>), Universal Corp. (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/UVV/GF-Score/United+States+Steel+Corp\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:NYSE:UVV;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">NYSE:UVV</a>) and G-III Apparel Group Ltd. (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/GIII/GF-Score/United+States+Steel+Corp\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:NASDAQ:GIII;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">NASDAQ:GIII</a>).</p>\n<h3>U.S. Steel</h3>\n<p>Once the world\'s largest corporation, U.S. Steel (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/X/GF-Score/United+States+Steel+Corp\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:NYSE:X;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">NYSE:X</a>) is now a mere mid-sized company, and the second-largest steel producer in America, behind Nucor Corp. (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/NUE/GF-Score/United+States+Steel+Corp\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:NYSE:NUE;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">NYSE:NUE</a>). Its stock fell 16% in the first quarter.</p>\n<div class=\"caas-da \">\n <div data-wf-benji-page-context=\"{&quot;pageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/us-steel-humana-casualty-list-165436422.html&quot;,&quot;spaceid&quot;:&quot;1187300073&quot;,&quot;site&quot;:&quot;finance&quot;,&quot;hashtag&quot;:&quot;investments;stocks;finance&quot;,&quot;lmsid&quot;:&quot;a0Vd0000003tnQZEAY&quot;,&quot;lpstaid&quot;:&quot;368fbcdc-6ac6-3dd3-aa13-ecfb3f34adb0&quot;,&quot;pct&quot;:&quot;story&quot;}\" data-wf-benji-wafer-config=\"{}\" data-wf-benji-config=\"{&quot;positions&quot;:{&quot;INARTICLE-368fbcdc-6ac6-3dd3-aa13-ecfb3f34adb01711990866488&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;INARTICLE-368fbcdc-6ac6-3dd3-aa13-ecfb3f34adb01711990866488&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/22888152279/${REGION}/yfin/ros/dt/${REGION}_yfin_ros_dt_mid_center&quot;,&quot;region&quot;:&quot;index&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;fluid&quot;,&quot;kvs&quot;:{&quot;loc&quot;:&quot;mid_center&quot;},&quot;disableRefresh&quot;:true}}}\" id=\"sda-INARTICLE-368fbcdc-6ac6-3dd3-aa13-ecfb3f34adb01711990866488\" class=\"wafer-benji caas-sda-benji-ad\" data-wf-trigger=\"onLoad\" data-wf-margin=\"100 0\">\n  <div id=\"sdaAdvText-INARTICLE-368fbcdc-6ac6-3dd3-aa13-ecfb3f34adb01711990866488\" class=\"caas-sda-adv-text\">\n   ADVERTISEMENT\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"INARTICLE-368fbcdc-6ac6-3dd3-aa13-ecfb3f34adb01711990866488\"></div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<p>In late 2023, the company agreed to sell itself for about $15 billion to Nippon Steel (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/TSE:5401/GF-Score/United+States+Steel+Corp\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:TSE:5401;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">TSE:5401</a>), the largest steel company in Japan. That price tag was almost double what Cleveland-Cliffs Inc. (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/CLF/GF-Score/United+States+Steel+Corp\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:NYSE:CLF;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">NYSE:CLF</a>) had offered in mid-2023.</p>\n<p>But President Biden said last month that it is vital for it to remain an American steel company. Former President Donald Trump also opposes the takeover.</p>\n<p>That leaves the company\'s future in doubt. I think it probably will be sold sometime in 2025 or 2026, after the U.S. election is over. Be that as it may, let\'s assume that the company remains independent.</p>\n<p>The stock, at about $41, sells for 12 times earnings. Profitability is mediocre, but the company has posted three straight annual profits. The debtto-equity ratio is pretty good, at 39%. All in all, this looks like a moderate gainer to me, and more if a takeover happens.</p>\n<h3>Humana</h3>\n<p>Down a whopping 24% in the first quarter, Humana Inc. (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/HUM/GF-Score/United+States+Steel+Corp\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:NYSE:HUM;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">NYSE:HUM</a>) is one of the largest health insurance companies in the U.S. It specializes in insuring Medicare and Medicaid patients and people in the military.</p>\n<p>One problem was a massive cyberattack in February that disrupted the flow of billions of dollars in the health care industry. But even before that, Humana shares were weak as the company said it couldn\'t cut costs fast enough to maintain profits amidst rising health care costs.</p>\n<div class=\"caas-readmore caas-readmore-collapse\">\n <button class=\"link caas-button collapse-button\" data-ylk=\"elm:readmore;slk:Story continues\">Story continues</button>\n</div>\n<p>Humana posted a loss in the fourth quarter of 2023. However, it has shown a profit for 24 years in a row, and I believe it can right the ship.</p>\n<p>The stock sells for 41% of per-share revenue. If it can get back to the median ratio for the past decade (64%), the stock would rise from the current $347 to about $540.</p>\n<h3>Universal</h3>\n<p>I would like it if everyone in the world stopped smoking tomorrow. But of course that won\'t happen. There is a gradual diminution in tobacco smoking. According to Statista, 5.80 billion cigarettes were smoked worldwide in 2009, but only 5.10 billion in 2020.</p>\n<p>Universal Corp. (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/UVV/GF-Score/United+States+Steel+Corp\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:NYSE:UVV;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">NYSE:UVV</a>), based in Richmond, Virginia, sells leaf tobacco to cigarette makers. Over the past decade its revenues are close to flat, increasing at a rate of 0.6% per year. The stock market is in love with growth, so investor interest in Universal is sparse.</p>\n<p>The stock was down 23% in the first quarter. But it\'s a good dividend payer, offering a 6.10% yield. It has increased its dividend each year for 54 years.</p>\n<h3>G-III</h3>\n<p>G-III Apparel Group (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/GIII/GF-Score/United+States+Steel+Corp\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:NASDAQ:GIII;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">NASDAQ:GIII</a>) makes clothing under many brands, notably Calvin Klein, DKNY, Donna Karan, Karl Lagerfeld and Tommy Hilfiger. The rag trade is notoriously difficult, but G-III has shown a profit in nine of the past 10 years.</p>\n<p>The stock declined more than 13% in the first quarter, bringing its price-earnings ratio down to about 8, which I consider bargain territory. Over the past decade, the median ratio for this stock has been about 17.</p>\n<h3>Track record</h3>\n<p>I\'ve been compiling the Casualty List since mid-2000. One-year returns can be calculated for 80 lists. (The one you\'re reading is number 84.)</p>\n<p>My picks from a year ago were egregious, dropping 8.97% while the Standard &amp; Poor\'s 500 Total Return Index soared 29.40%. My biggest sin was picking First Republic Bank (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/FRCB/GF-Score/United+States+Steel+Corp\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:FRCB;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">FRCB</a>), which failed and was taken over by J.P. Morgan Chase &amp; Co. (<a class=\"link \" href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/gf_score/JPM/GF-Score/United+States+Steel+Corp\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:NYSE:JPM;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\">NYSE:JPM</a>). The stock plummeted more than 99%.</p>\n<p>Over the years, though, the Casualty List has been a good source of investment ideas. The average 12-month return on my selections has been 14.57% compared to 10.81% for the S&amp;P 500.</p>\n<p>Fifty of the 80 lists have shown a profit, but only 39 lists have beaten the index.</p>\n<p>Bear in mind that my column results are hypothetical and shouldn\'t be confused with results I obtain for clients. Also, past performance doesn\'t predict the future.</p>\n<p><em>John Dorfman is chairman of Dorfman Value Investments LLC in Boston, Massachusetts. He or his clients may own or trade securities discussed in this column. He can be reached at </em><a href=\"mailto:jdorfman@dorfmanvalue.com\" data-ylk=\"slk:jdorfman@dorfmanvalue.com;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \"><em>jdorfman@dorfmanvalue.com</em></a><em>. </em></p>\n<p>This article first appeared on <a href=\"https://www.gurufocus.com/news/2403078/us-steel-and-humana-are-on-the-casualty-list?r=caf6fe0e0db70d936033da5461e60141\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-ylk=\"slk:GuruFocus;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas\" class=\"link \">GuruFocus</a>.<br></p>', NULL, 89457, 0, '2024-04-01 12:54:36', '2024-04-01 13:01:07', 10);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (27252, 'UPDATE 1-Advent to buy Ryan Reynolds-backed fintech Nuvei in $6.3 bln deal', '<p>(Adds details and context throughout)</p>\n<p>April 1 - Private equity firm Advent International has agreed to buy Canada\'s Nuvei in a deal that values the payments technology firm, which has received financial backing from actor Ryan Reynolds, at $6.3 billion.</p>\n<p>The deal, valued at $34 per share, will take Nuvei private almost four years after the company was</p>\n<p>listed</p>\n<p>on the Toronto Stock Exchange. It represents a premium of 56% to the company\'s closing price before a potential deal was reported in the media in mid-March.</p>\n<p>Nuvei provides payments technology to businesses, allowing them to pay and accept payments regardless of their customers\' location or preferred payment method. (Reporting by Niket Nishant in Bengaluru; Editing by Shilpi Majumdar and Maju Samuel)</p>', NULL, 11957, 0, '2024-04-01 12:40:24', '2024-04-01 13:01:07', 10);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (27253, '一年一度的华府风筝节，在春日和风中引来了大批民众参与', '<p>2024年的春天来得早，三月中樱花已开得灿烂。应景的风筝大会，在周六一个风和日丽的早上缓缓展开。</p>\n<div class=\"wsw__embed wsw__embed--small\"> \n <figure class=\"media-image js-media-expand\"> \n  <div class=\"img-wrap\"> \n   <div class=\"thumb\"> \n    <img alt=\"3月30日, 风和日丽，国会大草坪上也聚集了大批放风筝的群众 (美国之音/莫干生)\" src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-ccf5-08dc5242575a_w250_r0_s.jpg\"> \n   </div> <span class=\"ico ico-fullscreen ico--media-expand ico--rounded\"></span> \n  </div> \n  <figcaption> <span class=\"caption\">3月30日, 风和日丽，国会大草坪上也聚集了大批放风筝的群众 (美国之音/莫干生)</span> \n  </figcaption> \n </figure> \n</div> \n<p>亚马逊HQ2社区参与主管派克·菲利皮(Patrick Phlippi)说,“今天的风筝节是一家人可以出来放风筝的日子。从风筝专家到以前从未放过风筝的，每个人都可以把自己的风筝拿出来。你还可以制作风筝，我认为这是一天里最酷的部分。你可以制作自己的风筝。而且天气很好。这是充满乐趣的一天。这确实是个标志性的日子。我认为华盛顿特区没有什么比在国家大草坪上场庆祝春天更好的了。”</p> \n<p>今年大会邀请了，来自日本的风筝大师土岐干男(Mikio Toki),专程参与，教授制作风筝的技巧和分享他放风筝的乐趣。</p> \n<p>土岐干男说:“我从小就非常喜欢冬天放风筝。我遇到了一位年纪非常大的放风筝老人，我和他交谈。他是一位风筝大师，是江户东京流派的风筝大师，我主要追随他学习。之后，我还有向其他风筝大师请教。”</p>\n<div class=\"wsw__embed wsw__embed--small wsw__embed--pull-right\"> \n <figure class=\"media-image js-media-expand\"> \n  <div class=\"img-wrap\"> \n   <div class=\"thumb\"> \n    <img alt=\"风筝大师土岐干男的美日友好风筝，长100米，各有50面美日国旗，梅花间竹的排列着 (美国之音/莫干生)\" src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-bdaf-08dc5242f0a9_w250_r0_s.jpg\"> \n   </div> <span class=\"ico ico-fullscreen ico--media-expand ico--rounded\"></span> \n  </div> \n  <figcaption> <span class=\"caption\">风筝大师土岐干男的美日友好风筝，长100米，各有50面美日国旗，梅花间竹的排列着 (美国之音/莫干生)</span> \n  </figcaption> \n </figure> \n</div>\n<div class=\"wsw__embed wsw__embed--small\"> \n <figure class=\"media-image js-media-expand\"> \n  <div class=\"img-wrap\"> \n   <div class=\"thumb\"> \n    <img alt=\"风筝大师土岐干男在展示他为华府樱花风筝节准备的另一个作品。 他以狮王图案为构图，命名为“歌舞伎”风筝 (美国之音/莫干生)\" src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-a61b-08dc52431a78_w250_r0_s.jpg\"> \n   </div> <span class=\"ico ico-fullscreen ico--media-expand ico--rounded\"></span> \n  </div> \n  <figcaption> <span class=\"caption\">风筝大师土岐干男在展示他为华府樱花风筝节准备的另一个作品。 他以狮王图案为构图，命名为“歌舞伎”风筝 (美国之音/莫干生)</span> \n  </figcaption> \n </figure> \n</div> \n<p>土岐干男特别为今年的风筝大会准备了两只风格截然不同的风筝。</p> \n<p>首先是一只六角型以狮王图案为构图，命名为“歌舞伎”的风筝。另外一只风筝名叫“美日友好”。这只风筝长100米，各有50面美日国旗，梅花间竹的排列着。在华府国家大草坪上飞舞，引来了大批群众观看。</p>\n<div class=\"wsw__embed\"> \n <figure class=\"media-image js-media-expand\"> \n  <div class=\"img-wrap\"> \n   <div class=\"thumb\"> \n    <img alt=\"2024华府樱花风筝节，今年的特别嘉宾是来自日本的风筝大师土岐干男 (美国之音/莫干生)\" src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-9e3a-08dc52433ff1_w250_r0_s.jpg\"> \n   </div> <span class=\"ico ico-fullscreen ico--media-expand ico--rounded\"></span> \n  </div> \n  <figcaption> <span class=\"caption\">2024华府樱花风筝节，今年的特别嘉宾是来自日本的风筝大师土岐干男 (美国之音/莫干生)</span> \n  </figcaption> \n </figure> \n</div> \n<p>中午后，华盛顿纪念碑前，千帆竞发，空中飘扬着各种型态五彩十色的风筝，把2024的樱花节风筝大会推到了顶峰。</p>', NULL, 89437, 0, '2024-04-01 12:18:54', '2024-04-01 14:00:00', 1);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (27254, 'Cameroun : le manque de civisme à l\'œuvre le long de l\'autoroute Yaoundé-Douala', '<p>Au Cameroun, l\'incivisme sur le nouvel autoroute Yaoundé-Douala inquiète les autorités. Sur la bretelle qui conduit vers cette infrastructure routière ou le long de l’itinéraire, des riverains multiplient des comportements à risque.<br> <br> Au lieu-dit Minkoameyos, dans le 7e arrondissement de Yaoundé, le marché périodique de chaque samedi crée un bouchon énorme. Le marché de Minkoameyos a considérablement réduit la chaussée sur l’unique bretelle qui conduit vers l’autoroute Yaoundé-Douala.</p>\n<div class=\"wsw__embed\"> \n <figure class=\"media-image\"> \n  <div class=\"img-wrap\"> \n   <div class=\"thumb\"> \n    <img alt=\"Une affiche de la campagne de sensibilisation les comportements des riverains de l’autoroute Yaoundé-Douala à Yaoundé le 30 mars 2024.\" src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-43f1-08dc5261f025_w250_r0_s.jpg\"> \n   </div> \n  </div> \n  <figcaption> <span class=\"caption\">Une affiche de la campagne de sensibilisation les comportements des riverains de l’autoroute Yaoundé-Douala à Yaoundé le 30 mars 2024.</span> \n  </figcaption> \n </figure> \n</div> \n<p><em>\"On ne doit pas laisser ces gens ici, c’est l’autoroute, que la mairie fasse les efforts d’enlever ces gens ici\"</em>, lâche visiblement irrité, Jean Tabi Essomba, un natif de Minkoameyos. Chaque samedi, il tente de mettre de l’ordre à cet endroit à titre bénévole, afin rendre la circulation fluide pour les véhicules qui empruntent l’autoroute.<br> <br> <em>\"Regardez, cette femme ne doit pas exposer ses marchandises, ça veut dire qu’ici il n’y a aucune planification, la mairie a beaucoup d’espace on peut faire des comptoirs là-bas, il y a déjà eu beaucoup d’accidents ici, les motos ont heurté les enfants et certains sont morts\"</em>, confie-t-il à VOA.</p> \n<p>Les commerçants sont eux-mêmes résignés. <em>\"De temps en temps, la mairie nous dit qu’on ne doit pas vendre en bordure de route et nous posons la question de savoir, en tant que natifs, où allons-nous exposer nos marchandises ? Le maire nous a dit qu’il devait nous déporter à plus de 3 km vers l’Irad, mais on n’est pas encore fixés\"</em>, relate Clément Dzou, un vendeur de poulets.<br> <br> Marie Essomba est une commerçante du marché de Minkoameyos. Cette sexagénaire vend des vivres frais depuis une vingtaine d’années à cet endroit. <em>\"Nous savons que c’est un danger, mas nous sommes déjà habitués</em>, explique-t-elle.<em> Les habitants d’ici veulent un marché proche de leur résidence.\"</em></p>\n<div class=\"wsw__embed\"> \n <figure class=\"media-image js-media-expand\"> \n  <div class=\"img-wrap\"> \n   <div class=\"thumb\"> \n    <img alt=\"Les trottoirs de la bretelle qui conduit à l’autoroute Yaoundé- Douala occupés par les vivres au marché de Minkoameyos, à Yaoundé\" src=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-9dba-08dc52615146_w250_r1_s.jpg\"> \n   </div> <span class=\"ico ico-fullscreen ico--media-expand ico--rounded\"></span> \n  </div> \n  <figcaption> <span class=\"caption\">Les trottoirs de la bretelle qui conduit à l’autoroute Yaoundé- Douala occupés par les vivres au marché de Minkoameyos, à Yaoundé</span> \n  </figcaption> \n </figure> \n</div> \n<p>Ailleurs, les riverains se plaignent du fait que l\'infrastructure routière a restreint leurs mouvements et espaces de vie. <em>\"Cette autoroute a divisé des villages, ce qui fait que nous avons aujourd’hui des difficultés pour aller d’un village à l’autre ou pour aller dans nos plantations parce que les traversées pour piétons n’ont pas été prévues</em>, affirme Jean Pascal Nken Nemb, maire de Bot makak une commune de la région du Centre. <em>En plus les passerelles sont très distantes, ce qui fait que certains habitants doivent parcourir 7 ou 8 km pour aller dans leurs champs.\"</em><br> <br> Conséquence, certains riverains ont pris le risque de créer leurs propres voies de contournement pour rallier l’autoroute.</p> \n<p><em>\"Il a fallu informer sur les comportements à avoir pour réduire les risques d’accidents, il y a déjà une campagne d’information et de prévention qui est menée par les équipes de la gendarmerie</em>, détaille Emmanuel Nganou Djoumessi, le ministre des Travaux publics.<em> Nous allons aménager des voies de contournements, l’autoroute ne pouvant pas être empruntée n’importe comment, pour que les populations riveraines retrouvent une possibilité de mobilité.\"</em><br> <br> Le principal syndicat de fret par camions a lui aussi prévu de sensibiliser les camionneurs qui vont emprunter cette autoroute.</p> \n<p><em>\"A certains points importants à l’instar de la localité de Boumyebel, on va procéder à la formation à l’information aux recyclage même Nous allons nous doter des simulateurs qui vont nous permettre de mieux cerner les contours quant à l’utilisation des autoroutes, nous aurions plus besoin des gendarmes qui vont venir nous dire ce qu’il faut faire, il faudrait que nous-mêmes nous puissions nous imprégner des réalités et nous avancions dans le même sens\"</em>, soutient El Hadj Oumarou, président du bureau de gestion de fret terrestre.</p> \n<div class=\"wsw__embed\"> \n <div class=\"media-pholder media-pholder--audio media-pholder--embed\"> \n  <div class=\"c-sticky-container\" data-poster=\"https://gdb.voanews.com/01000000-0aff-0242-b209-08dc5261b550_cx0_cy13_cw100_w250_r1.jpg\"> \n   <div class=\"c-sticky-element\" data-sp_api=\"pangea-video\" data-persistent data-persistent-browse-out> \n    <div class=\"c-mmp c-mmp--enabled c-mmp--loading c-mmp--audio c-mmp--embed c-mmp--has-poster c-sticky-element__swipe-el\" data-player_id=\"\" data-title=\"Cameroun : Incivisme sur l\'autoroute Yaoundé-Douala malgré une campagne de sensibilisation\" data-hide-title=\"False\" data-breakpoint_s=\"320\" data-breakpoint_m=\"640\" data-breakpoint_l=\"992\" data-hlsjs-src=\"/Scripts/responsive/hls.b\" data-bypass-dash-for-vod=\"t