INSERT INTO `text_lang` VALUES (1, '    1新用户注册后必须通过实名认证审核。\n    2姓名和身份证号码一经认证不予修改。\n    3真实姓名必须和身份证号码一致。', 'App实名认证页面规则', 0, NULL, '1. New users must pass the real-name authentication review after registration. 2. Once the name and ID number are authenticated, they will not be modified. Please contact customer service for modification. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1新用戶註冊後必須通過實名認證審核。\n     2姓名和身分證號碼一經認證不予修改。\n     3真實姓名必須和身分證號碼一致。', '1. New users must pass the real-name authentication review after registration. 2. Once the name and ID number are authenticated, they will not be modified. Please contact customer service for modification. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1. New users must pass the real-name authentication review after registration. 2. Once the name and ID number are authenticated, they will not be modified. Please contact customer service for modification. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1. New users must pass the real-name authentication review after registration. 2. Once the name and ID number are authenticated, they will not be modified. Please contact customer service for modification. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1. Pengguna baru harus lulus peninjauan autentikasi nama asli setelah pendaftaran. 2. Setelah nama dan nomor ID diautentikasi, tidak akan diubah. Silahkan hubungi layanan pelanggan untuk modifikasi. 3. Nama asli harus sesuai dengan nama rekening kartu bank penarikan.', '1 新規ユーザーは登録後、実名認証審査を通過する必要があります。\n     2名前とID番号は一度認証されると変更されません。\n     3. 本名は ID 番号と一致している必要があります。', '1 신규 이용자는 회원가입 후 실명인증 심사를 통과해야 합니다.\n     2성명과 주민등록번호는 한번 인증되면 수정되지 않습니다.\n     3. 실명이 반드시 주민등록번호와 일치해야 합니다.', '1. New users must pass the real-name authentication review after registration. 2. Once the name and ID number are authenticated, they will not be modified. Please contact customer service for modification. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1 ผู้ใช้ใหม่จะต้องผ่านการตรวจสอบการรับรองความถูกต้องของชื่อจริงหลังการลงทะเบียน\n     2ชื่อและหมายเลขประจำตัวจะไม่ได้รับการแก้ไขเมื่อได้รับการยืนยันแล้ว\n     3. ชื่อจริงต้องตรงกับเลขประจำตัวประชาชน', '1 Người dùng mới phải vượt qua bước đánh giá xác thực tên thật sau khi đăng ký.\n     2Tên và số ID sẽ không được sửa đổi sau khi được xác minh.\n     3. Tên thật phải trùng với số CMND.', '1. New users must pass the real-name authentication review after registration. 2. Once the name and ID number are authenticated, they will not be modified. Please contact customer service for modification. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1. New users must pass the real-name authentication review after registration. 2. Once the name and ID number are authenticated, they will not be modified. Please contact customer service for modification. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1. New users must pass the real-name authentication review after registration. 2. Once the name and ID number are authenticated, they will not be modified. Please contact customer service for modification. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1. नए उपयोगकर्ताओं को पंजीकरण के बाद वास्तविक नाम प्रमाणीकरण समीक्षा पास करनी होगी। 2. एक बार नाम और आईडी नंबर प्रमाणित हो जाने के बाद, उन्हें संशोधित नहीं किया जाएगा। कृपया संशोधन के लिए ग्राहक सेवा से संपर्क करें। 3. वास्तविक नाम निकासी बैंक कार्ड के खाते के नाम के अनुरूप होना चाहिए।', '1. New users must pass the real-name authentication review after registration. 2. Once the name and ID number are authenticated, they will not be modified. Please contact customer service for modification. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1. New users must pass the real-name authentication review after registration. 2. Once the name and ID number are authenticated, they will not be modified. Please contact customer service for modification. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1. I nuovi utenti devono superare la revisione dell\'autenticazione del nome reale dopo la registrazione. 2. Una volta autenticati, il nome e il numero ID non verranno modificati. Si prega di contattare il servizio clienti per la modifica. 3. Il nome reale deve essere coerente con il nome del conto della carta bancaria di prelievo.');
INSERT INTO `text_lang` VALUES (2, '    1新用户注册后必须通过添加银行卡。\n    2用户只能添加一张本人银行卡。\n    3真实姓名必须和出金银行卡户名一致。', 'App银行卡页面面规则', 1, NULL, '1. New users must add a bank card after registration. 2. The user can only add one personal bank card. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1新用戶註冊後必須透過新增銀行卡。\n     2用戶只能新增一張本人銀行卡。\n     3真實姓名必須和出金銀行卡戶名一致。', '1 Neue Benutzer müssen nach der Registrierung eine Bankkarte hinzufügen.\n     2Benutzer können nur eine persönliche Bankkarte hinzufügen.\n     3. Der echte Name muss mit dem Kontonamen auf der Auszahlungskarte übereinstimmen.', '1. New users must add a bank card after registration. 2. The user can only add one personal bank card. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1 Les nouveaux utilisateurs doivent ajouter une carte bancaire après l\'inscription.\n     2Les utilisateurs ne peuvent ajouter qu\'une seule carte bancaire personnelle.\n     3. Le vrai nom doit être cohérent avec le nom du compte figurant sur la carte bancaire de retrait.', '1. Pengguna baru harus menambahkan kartu bank setelah pendaftaran. 2. Pengguna hanya dapat menambahkan satu kartu bank pribadi. 3. Nama asli harus sesuai dengan nama rekening kartu bank penarikan.', '1 新規ユーザーは登録後に銀行カードを追加する必要があります。\n     2 ユーザーが追加できる個人用銀行カードは 1 枚だけです。\n     3. 本名は、引き出し用銀行カードの口座名と一致している必要があります。', '1 신규 사용자는 등록 후 은행 카드를 추가해야 합니다.\n     2사용자는 개인 은행 카드를 하나만 추가할 수 있습니다.\n     3. 실명은 출금은행카드의 계좌명과 일치해야 합니다.', '1. New users must add a bank card after registration. 2. The user can only add one personal bank card. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1 ผู้ใช้ใหม่จะต้องเพิ่มบัตรธนาคารหลังจากการลงทะเบียน\n     2ผู้ใช้สามารถเพิ่มบัตรธนาคารส่วนบุคคลได้เพียงใบเดียวเท่านั้น\n     3. ชื่อจริงจะต้องสอดคล้องกับชื่อบัญชีบนบัตรธนาคารที่ถอนเงิน', '1 Người dùng mới phải thêm thẻ ngân hàng sau khi đăng ký.\n     2Người dùng chỉ có thể thêm một thẻ ngân hàng cá nhân.\n     3. Tên thật phải trùng với tên tài khoản trên thẻ ngân hàng rút tiền.', '1. New users must add a bank card after registration. 2. The user can only add one personal bank card. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1. New users must add a bank card after registration. 2. The user can only add one personal bank card. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1. New users must add a bank card after registration. 2. The user can only add one personal bank card. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1. नए उपयोगकर्ताओं को पंजीकरण के बाद एक बैंक कार्ड जोड़ना होगा। 2. उपयोगकर्ता केवल एक व्यक्तिगत बैंक कार्ड जोड़ सकता है। 3. वास्तविक नाम निकासी बैंक कार्ड के खाते के नाम के अनुरूप होना चाहिए।', '1. New users must add a bank card after registration. 2. The user can only add one personal bank card. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1. New users must add a bank card after registration. 2. The user can only add one personal bank card. 3. The real name must be consistent with the account name of the withdrawal bank card.', '1. I nuovi utenti devono aggiungere una carta bancaria dopo la registrazione. 2. L\'utente può aggiungere solo una carta bancaria personale. 3. Il nome reale deve essere coerente con il nome del conto della carta bancaria di prelievo.');
INSERT INTO `text_lang` VALUES (3, '1.当前有持仓订单不能出金 。\n2.提现请先在官网通过实名认证和绑定数字钱包 。\n3.提现时段内2小时到账，最迟次日24点前到账。\n4.如果发现洗钱行为，将冻结账户，并追究法律责任。', 'App提现页面规则', 2, NULL, '1. If you currently have a position order, you cannot withdraw money.\n2. To withdraw cash, please first pass the real-name authentication and bind the digital wallet on the official website.\n3. The funds will be credited within 2 hours during the withdrawal period, and the funds will be credited before 24:00 the next day at the latest.\n4. If money laundering is discovered, the account will be frozen and legal responsibility will be pursued.', '1.目前有持倉訂單不能出金 。\n2.提現請先在官網通過實名認證和綁定數位錢包 。\n3.提現時段內2小時到賬，最晚隔日24點前到賬。\n4.如果發現洗錢行為，將凍結帳戶，並追究法律責任。', '1. Wenn Sie aktuell einen Positionsauftrag haben, können Sie kein Geld abheben.\n2. Um Bargeld abzuheben, müssen Sie zunächst die Authentifizierung mit echtem Namen bestehen und die digitale Geldbörse auf der offiziellen Website binden.\n3. Die Gutschrift erfolgt innerhalb von 2 Stunden während der Auszahlungsfrist und spätestens vor 24:00 Uhr des nächsten Tages.\n4. Bei Feststellung einer Geldwäsche wird das Konto gesperrt und rechtliche Schritte eingeleitet.', '1. If you currently have a position order, you cannot withdraw money.\n2. To withdraw cash, please first pass the real-name authentication and bind the digital wallet on the official website.\n3. The funds will be credited within 2 hours during the withdrawal period, and the funds will be credited before 24:00 the next day at the latest.\n4. If money laundering is discovered, the account will be frozen and legal responsibility will be pursued.', '1. Si vous disposez actuellement d’un ordre de position, vous ne pouvez pas retirer d’argent.\n2. Pour retirer de l\'argent, veuillez d\'abord passer l\'authentification par votre nom réel et lier le portefeuille numérique sur le site officiel.\n3. Les fonds seront crédités dans les 2 heures pendant le délai de rétractation, et les fonds seront crédités au plus tard avant 24h00 le lendemain.\n4. Si un blanchiment d\'argent est découvert, le compte sera gelé et la responsabilité légale sera engagée.', '1. If you currently have a position order, you cannot withdraw money.\n2. To withdraw cash, please first pass the real-name authentication and bind the digital wallet on the official website.\n3. The funds will be credited within 2 hours during the withdrawal period, and the funds will be credited before 24:00 the next day at the latest.\n4. If money laundering is discovered, the account will be frozen and legal responsibility will be pursued.', '1. 現在ポジション注文がある場合、出金することはできません。\n2. 現金を引き出すには、まず実名認証を通過し、公式ウェブサイトでデジタルウォレットをバインドしてください。\n3. 出金期間中は2時間以内に入金され、遅くとも翌日24時までに入金されます。\n4. マネーロンダリングが発覚した場合、口座が凍結され法的責任が追及されます。', '1. 현재 포지션 주문이 있는 경우에는 출금이 불가능합니다.\n2. 현금 출금을 위해서는 먼저 실명인증을 통과한 후 공식 홈페이지에서 전자지갑을 연동하시기 바랍니다.\n3. 출금기간 중 2시간 이내에 적립되며, 늦어도 익일 24시 이전에는 적립됩니다.\n4. 자금세탁이 적발될 경우 해당 계정을 동결시키고 법적 책임을 추궁할 것입니다.', '1. If you currently have a position order, you cannot withdraw money.\n2. To withdraw cash, please first pass the real-name authentication and bind the digital wallet on the official website.\n3. The funds will be credited within 2 hours during the withdrawal period, and the funds will be credited before 24:00 the next day at the latest.\n4. If money laundering is discovered, the account will be frozen and legal responsibility will be pursued.', '1. หากคุณมี Position Order อยู่ คุณจะไม่สามารถถอนเงินได้\n2. หากต้องการถอนเงินสด โปรดผ่านการตรวจสอบชื่อจริงและผูกกระเป๋าเงินดิจิทัลบนเว็บไซต์อย่างเป็นทางการก่อน\n3. เงินจะเข้าบัญชีภายใน 2 ชั่วโมงในช่วงระยะเวลาการถอนเงิน และเงินจะเข้าบัญชีก่อน 24:00 น. ของวันถัดไปอย่างช้าที่สุด\n4. หากพบว่ามีการฟอกเงิน บัญชีจะถูกระงับและจะดำเนินการตามความรับผิดชอบทางกฎหมาย', '1. Nếu bạn hiện đang có lệnh vị thế, bạn không thể rút tiền.\n2. Để rút tiền mặt, trước tiên vui lòng vượt qua xác thực tên thật và liên kết ví kỹ thuật số trên trang web chính thức.\n3. Tiền sẽ được ghi có trong vòng 2 giờ trong thời gian rút tiền và tiền sẽ được ghi có chậm nhất trước 24:00 ngày hôm sau.\n4. Nếu phát hiện rửa tiền, tài khoản sẽ bị phong tỏa và truy cứu trách nhiệm pháp lý.', '1. If you currently have a position order, you cannot withdraw money.\n2. To withdraw cash, please first pass the real-name authentication and bind the digital wallet on the official website.\n3. The funds will be credited within 2 hours during the withdrawal period, and the funds will be credited before 24:00 the next day at the latest.\n4. If money laundering is discovered, the account will be frozen and legal responsibility will be pursued.', '1. There is currently an open position order that cannot be withdrawn. 2. To withdraw funds, please pass the real-name authentication and bind the bank card on the official website first. 3. The withdrawal time is between 9:00 and 15:00 on weekdays. 4. A handling fee of RMB 10 will be deducted for each withdrawal. 5. The minimum amount for each withdrawal is 100 yuan. 6. During the withdrawal period, the withdrawal usually arrives within 2 hours. The withdrawal time is affected by the inter-bank clearing time. The arrival time of each bank is different.', '1. There is currently an open position order that cannot be withdrawn. 2. To withdraw funds, please pass the real-name authentication and bind the bank card on the official website first. 3. The withdrawal time is between 9:00 and 15:00 on weekdays. 4. A handling fee of RMB 10 will be deducted for each withdrawal. 5. The minimum amount for each withdrawal is 100 yuan. 6. During the withdrawal period, the withdrawal usually arrives within 2 hours. The withdrawal time is affected by the inter-bank clearing time. The arrival time of each bank is different.', '1. If you currently have a position order, you cannot withdraw money.\n2. To withdraw cash, please first pass the real-name authentication and bind the digital wallet on the official website.\n3. The funds will be credited within 2 hours during the withdrawal period, and the funds will be credited before 24:00 the next day at the latest.\n4. If money laundering is discovered, the account will be frozen and legal responsibility will be pursued.', '1. If you currently have a position order, you cannot withdraw money.\n2. To withdraw cash, please first pass the real-name authentication and bind the digital wallet on the official website.\n3. The funds will be credited within 2 hours during the withdrawal period, and the funds will be credited before 24:00 the next day at the latest.\n4. If money laundering is discovered, the account will be frozen and legal responsibility will be pursued.', '1. If you currently have a position order, you cannot withdraw money.\n2. To withdraw cash, please first pass the real-name authentication and bind the digital wallet on the official website.\n3. The funds will be credited within 2 hours during the withdrawal period, and the funds will be credited before 24:00 the next day at the latest.\n4. If money laundering is discovered, the account will be frozen and legal responsibility will be pursued.', '1. If you currently have a position order, you cannot withdraw money.\n2. To withdraw cash, please first pass the real-name authentication and bind the digital wallet on the official website.\n3. The funds will be credited within 2 hours during the withdrawal period, and the funds will be credited before 24:00 the next day at the latest.\n4. If money laundering is discovered, the account will be frozen and legal responsibility will be pursued.');
INSERT INTO `text_lang` VALUES (4, '1.保证金：您用于投资股票的资金，起点相当低。\r\n2.操盘期限；按天计算，不包含各类法定节假日。\r\n3.按天支付管理费（不包含交交易印花税，过户费和佣金），无任何其他费用\r\n4.如操盘10天，一次性收取10天管理费\r\n5.交易日当天14：50之前的申请于当日生效（当天开始收取账户管理费），交易日当天14：50后的申请于下个交易日生效。\r\n6.股市有风险，投资需谨慎。', 'App按天配资规则', 3, NULL, '1. Margin: The funds you use to invest in stocks, the starting point is quite low. 2. The trading period is calculated on a daily basis, excluding various statutory holidays. 3. Pay the management fee on a daily basis (excluding transaction stamp duty, transfer fee and commission), without any other fees. 4. If you trade for 10 days, you will be charged a 10-day management fee at one time. 5. Apply before 14:50 on the trading day It will take effect on the same day (the account management fee will be charged on the same day), and the application after 14:50 on the trading day will take effect on the next trading day. 6. The stock market is risky, and investment needs to be cautious.', '1. Margin: The funds you use to invest in stocks, the starting point is quite low. 2. The trading period is calculated on a daily basis, excluding various statutory holidays. 3. Pay the management fee on a daily basis (excluding transaction stamp duty, transfer fee and commission), without any other fees. 4. If you trade for 10 days, you will be charged a 10-day management fee at one time. 5. Apply before 14:50 on the trading day It will take effect on the same day (the account management fee will be charged on the same day), and the application after 14:50 on the trading day will take effect on the next trading day. 6. The stock market is risky, and investment needs to be cautious.', '1. Margin: The funds you use to invest in stocks, the starting point is quite low. 2. The trading period is calculated on a daily basis, excluding various statutory holidays. 3. Pay the management fee on a daily basis (excluding transaction stamp duty, transfer fee and commission), without any other fees. 4. If you trade for 10 days, you will be charged a 10-day management fee at one time. 5. Apply before 14:50 on the trading day It will take effect on the same day (the account management fee will be charged on the same day), and the application after 14:50 on the trading day will take effect on the next trading day. 6. The stock market is risky, and investment needs to be cautious.', '1. Margin: The funds you use to invest in stocks, the starting point is quite low. 2. The trading period is calculated on a daily basis, excluding various statutory holidays. 3. Pay the management fee on a daily basis (excluding transaction stamp duty, transfer fee and commission), without any other fees. 4. If you trade for 10 days, you will be charged a 10-day management fee at one time. 5. Apply before 14:50 on the trading day It will take effect on the same day (the account management fee will be charged on the same day), and the application after 14:50 on the trading day will take effect on the next trading day. 6. The stock market is risky, and investment needs to be cautious.', '1. Margin: The funds you use to invest in stocks, the starting point is quite low. 2. The trading period is calculated on a daily basis, excluding various statutory holidays. 3. Pay the management fee on a daily basis (excluding transaction stamp duty, transfer fee and commission), without any other fees. 4. If you trade for 10 days, you will be charged a 10-day management fee at one time. 5. Apply before 14:50 on the trading day It will take effect on the same day (the account management fee will be charged on the same day), and the application after 14:50 on the trading day will take effect on the next trading day. 6. The stock market is risky, and investment needs to be cautious.', '1. Margin: The funds you use to invest in stocks, the starting point is quite low. 2. The trading period is calculated on a daily basis, excluding various statutory holidays. 3. Pay the management fee on a daily basis (excluding transaction stamp duty, transfer fee and commission), without any other fees. 4. If you trade for 10 days, you will be charged a 10-day management fee at one time. 5. Apply before 14:50 on the trading day It will take effect on the same day (the account management fee will be charged on the same day), and the application after 14:50 on the trading day will take effect on the next trading day. 6. The stock market is risky, and investment needs to be cautious.', '1. Margin: The funds you use to invest in stocks, the starting point is quite low. 2. The trading period is calculated on a daily basis, excluding various statutory holidays. 3. Pay the management fee on a daily basis (excluding transaction stamp duty, transfer fee and commission), without any other fees. 4. If you trade for 10 days, you will be charged a 10-day management fee at one time. 5. Apply before 14:50 on the trading day It will take effect on the same day (the account management fee will be charged on the same day), and the application after 14:50 on the trading day will take effect on the next trading day. 6. The stock market is risky, and investment needs to be cautious.', '1. Margin: The funds you use to invest in stocks, the starting point is quite low. 2. The trading period is calculated on a daily basis, excluding various statutory holidays. 3. Pay the management fee on a daily basis (excluding transaction stamp duty, transfer fee and commission), without any other fees. 4. If you trade for 10 days, you will be charged a 10-day management fee at one time. 5. Apply before 14:50 on the trading day It will take effect on the same day (the account management fee will be charged on the same day), and the application after 14:50 on the trading day will take effect on the next trading day. 6. The stock market is risky, and investment needs to be cautious.', '1. Margin: The funds you use to invest in stocks, the starting point is quite low. 2. The trading period is calculated on a daily basis, excluding various statutory holidays. 3. Pay th