 funds you use to invest in stocks, the starting point is quite low. 2. The trading period is calculated on a daily basis, excluding various statutory holidays. 3. Pay the management fee on a daily basis (excluding transaction stamp duty, transfer fee and commission), without any other fees. 4. If you trade for 10 days, you will be charged a 10-day management fee at one time. 5. Apply before 14:50 on the trading day It will take effect on the same day (the account management fee will be charged on the same day), and the application after 14:50 on the trading day will take effect on the next trading day. 6. The stock market is risky, and investment needs to be cautious.', '1. Margin: The funds you use to invest in stocks, the starting point is quite low. 2. The trading period is calculated on a daily basis, excluding various statutory holidays. 3. Pay the management fee on a daily basis (excluding transaction stamp duty, transfer fee and commission), without any other fees. 4. If you trade for 10 days, you will be charged a 10-day management fee at one time. 5. Apply before 14:50 on the trading day It will take effect on the same day (the account management fee will be charged on the same day), and the application after 14:50 on the trading day will take effect on the next trading day. 6. The stock market is risky, and investment needs to be cautious.', '1. Margin: The funds you use to invest in stocks, the starting point is quite low. 2. The trading period is calculated on a daily basis, excluding various statutory holidays. 3. Pay the management fee on a daily basis (excluding transaction stamp duty, transfer fee and commission), without any other fees. 4. If you trade for 10 days, you will be charged a 10-day management fee at one time. 5. Apply before 14:50 on the trading day It will take effect on the same day (the account management fee will be charged on the same day), and the application after 14:50 on the trading day will take effect on the next trading day.